  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* monodromy at a numeric argument v: aux-space product L^(1)(v-θ1).L^(2)(v-θ2) *)\nTm[v_] := Tm[v] = Table[Sum[(KroneckerDelta[i, k] (v - thN[[1]]) id2 + hN E1[i, k]) . (KroneckerDelta[k, j] (v - thN[[2]]) id2 + hN E2[k, j]), {k, 3}], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n(* twist M on the right, T^M = T.M; quantum minor: rows antisymmetrized, column k at v-(k-1)h *)\nTMf[M_][i_, j_][v_] := Sum[Tm[v][[i, l]] M[[l, j]], {l, 3}];\nqminor[M_][I_, J_][v_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[TMf[M][σ[[k]], J[[k]]][v - (k - 1) hN], {k, Length[J]}], {σ, Permutations[I]}];\ntAt[M_, a_, v_] := Sum[qminor[M][I, I][v], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nuS = 1/7 + Range[0, 6]/3;\ntPoly[M_, a_] := Expand[Sum[tAt[M, a, uS[[k]]] Product[(u - uS[[l]])/(uS[[k]] - uS[[l]]), {l, DeleteCases[Range[7], k]}], {k, 7}]];\nZd = DiagonalMatrix[zN]; χ3z = Times @@ zN;\n{tTime, tZ} = AbsoluteTiming[Table[tPoly[Zd, a], {a, 3}]];\nchecks[\"qdet: t3 = χ3 ν1(u)ν2(u-h)ν3(u-2h)\"] = Union[Flatten[Expand[tZ[[3]] - χ3z nuP[1][u] nuP[2][u - hN] nuP[3][u - 2 hN] id2]]] === {0};\n{tTime, checks}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
