       "data": "Out[429]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{4.184625 \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\langle\\! \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\lvert \\text{qdet: t3 = $\\chi$3 $\\nu$1(u)$\\nu$2(u-h)$\\nu$3(u-2h)} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\to \\mathrm{True}\\rvert\\!\\rangle \\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
