  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "poles = Flatten[Table[{s, n}, {s, nL}, {n, Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]}], 1];\nxP[{s_, n_}] := thN[[s]] - n hN;\nwgt[p_] := wgt[p] = 1/Product[xP[p] - xP[q], {q, DeleteCases[poles, p]}];\n(* full Q's at a rational point, memoized; A = state index, \"vac\" = the w-vacuum *)\nQU[A_, j_, x_] := QU[A, j, x] = N[zN[[j]]^(x/hN), prec] (qu[[A, j]] /. X -> x);\nQD[A_Integer, i_, x_] := QD[A, i, x] = N[zN[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (qd[[A, i]] /. X -> x);\nQD[\"vac\", i_, x_] := QD[\"vac\", i, x] = N[wN[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (qdVac[[i]] /. X -> x);\n(* physical-space Gauss factors (L=1, numeric z) and the SoV vacuum x0 = (e1^T Pphys^-1)^{⊗2} *)\nrsN = rsSol /. numZW;\nPpp = MatrixExp[(1/zN[[1]]) Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[-(1/(zN[[1]] zN[[2]])) Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[((zN[[1]] + zN[[2]])/(zN[[1]] zN[[2]])) Ee[2, 3]];\nPmp = MatrixExp[(r[1] /. rsN) Ee[3, 2]] . MatrixExp[(r[2] /. rsN) Ee[3, 1]] . MatrixExp[(r[3] /. rsN) Ee[2, 1]];\nPdp = DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[(s[k] /. rsN)^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\nPph1 = Pmp . Pdp . Ppp; PphInv1 = Inverse[Pph1];\nx01 = First[{UnitVector[d1, 1]} . PphInv1]; x02 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[x01, x01]];\npsiQ[B_] := Product[With[{t = thN[[s]]}, (QU[B, 2, t - 2 hN] QU[B, 3, t - 3 hN] - QU[B, 3, t - 2 hN] QU[B, 2, t - 3 hN]) QU[B, 3, t - hN]], {s, nL}];\novl = Table[Ω2 . vecS[[B]], {B, nS}]; x0ovl = Table[x02 . vecS[[B]], {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"<x0|Psi_B> nonzero (min, not a zero test)\"] = Min[Abs[x0ovl]];\nchecks[\"<x0|Psi_B> nonzero (min, not a zero test)\"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
