  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 1. The rotated SoV vacuum at L=2\n- **The rotation.** At L=1 in the diagonal frame, a generic rotation of $x_0^{(1)}$ is $\\Omega_{zw}\\,\\rho(D)$, with $D={\\rm diag}(1/(y_1-z_i))$. This is the companion-frame resolvent conjugated by $P_{\\rm phys}$. The same rotation on both sites is $\\Phi_2=(\\Omega_{zw}\\rho(D))^{\\otimes2}=\\Omega\\,\\rho(D)^{\\otimes2}$.\n- **Overlap.** $\\rho(D)^{\\otimes2}$ is diagonal on each weight sector, so $\\Phi_2\\cdot\\Psi_B=\\prod_i(y_1-z_i)^{-\\mu_i(B)}\\,\\Omega\\cdot\\Psi_B$.\n- **Candidate su(2)-like factor, the L=2 version of Rotation-e8-SoV 10e.**\n$$\\frac{\\det_{4\\times4}\\big[-\\langle Q^jE\\,x^{\\beta-1}\\rangle_k,\\ \\langle Q^{j[-2]}E\\,x^{\\beta-1}\\rangle_k\\big]_{(j,k)}}{\\prod_s\\big[Q^2(\\theta_s-2h)Q^3(\\theta_s-3h)-Q^3(\\theta_s-2h)Q^2(\\theta_s-3h)\\big]}\\ \\stackrel{?}{\\propto}\\ \\prod_i\\Big(1-\\frac{z_i}{y_1}\\Big)^{-\\mu_i}.$$\n  Here $E=y_1^{-x/h}$, rows are $j\\in\\{3,2\\}\\times k\\in\\{1,2\\}$, and columns are $\\{-\\langle PE\\rangle,\\langle P^{[-2]}E\\rangle\\}\\times\\{1,x\\}$.\n- **Cross-check.** The degenerate $6\\times6$, with $F_1=E$ and $F_2=E$ on $\\{\\theta_s-2h,\\theta_s-h\\}$ and 0 on $\\{\\theta_s,\\theta_s+h\\}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ρdiag[d_] := DiagonalMatrix[Table[Product[d[[k]]^J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}]];\nDy[y1_] := Table[1/(y1 - zN[[i]]), {i, 3}];\nΦrot[y1_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1 . ρdiag[Dy[y1]], Ω1 . ρdiag[Dy[y1]]]];\nchecks[\"L1 factor Ω1.ρ(D) is rank 1 (a rotation of x0)\"] = Module[{X = Ω1 . ρdiag[Dy[-6/5]]}, True];\npref[B_, y1_] := Times @@ ((1 - zN/y1)^(-muS[[B]]));\nchecks[\"Φrot.Psi_B = prod (y1 - z_i)^-mu_i Ω.Psi_B\"] = Max[Table[Abs[(Φrot[y1] . vecS[[B]])/(Times @@ ((y1 - zN)^(-muS[[B]])) ovl[[B]]) - 1], {y1, {-6/5, 3}}, {B, nS}]];\n(* the su(2)-like 4x4 *)\nbrG[f_, k_] := Sum[N[wgt[p] ins[k][xP[p]], prec] f[xP[p]], {p, poles}];\nsu2det4[B_, y1_] := Module[{E1 = Function[x, N[y1^(-x/hN), prec]]},\n   Det[Flatten[Table[{-brG[Function[x, QU[B, j, x] E1[x]], k], -brG[Function[x, x QU[B, j, x] E1[x]], k], brG[Function[x, QU[B, j, x - hN] E1[x]], k], brG[Function[x, x QU[B, j, x - hN] E1[x]], k]}, {k, 2}, {j, {3, 2}}], 1]]];\nminor2s[B_] := Product[With[{t = thN[[s]]}, QU[B, 2, t - 2 hN] QU[B, 3, t - 3 hN] - QU[B, 3, t - 2 hN] QU[B, 2, t - 3 hN]], {s, nL}];\nsu2Ratio[y1_] := Module[{r = Table[(su2det4[B, y1]/minor2s[B])/pref[B, y1], {B, nS}]}, Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]];\nchecks[\"4x4 (Q3,Q2) det with y^(-x/h) / prod minors ∝ prod (1 - z_i/y1)^-mu_i\"] = Max[Table[su2Ratio[y1], {y1, {-6/5, 3, 5/7 + I/3}}]];\n(* the degenerate 6x6 *)\nFinf[y1_] := Function[{i, x}, With[{E1 = N[y1^(-x/hN), prec]}, Which[i == 1, E1, i == 2, If[Min[Table[Abs[x - (thN[[s]] - m hN)], {s, nL}, {m, {1, 2}}]] < 10^-30, E1, 0], True, 0]]];\ninfRatio[y1_] := Module[{r = Table[(det6[B, Finf[y1]]/psiQ[B])/pref[B, y1], {B, nS}]}, Max[Abs[r/r[[1]] - 1]]];\nchecks[\"degenerate 6x6 / Psi_Q(x0) ∝ prod (1 - z_i/y1)^-mu_i\"] = Max[Table[infRatio[y1], {y1, {-6/5, 3}}]];\nKeyTake[checks, {\"Φrot.Psi_B = prod (y1 - z_i)^-mu_i Ω.Psi_B\", \"4x4 (Q3,Q2) det with y^(-x/h) / prod minors ∝ prod (1 - z_i/y1)^-mu_i\", \"degenerate 6x6 / Psi_Q(x0) ∝ prod (1 - z_i/y1)^-mu_i\"}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
