   "value": "**Localization result.** On $x_0^{(1)}\\otimes x_0^{(1)}$, only $T_{11}$ and $T_{21}$ at $\\theta_1-2h$ localize; $T_{10}$, $T_{20}$ and other points do not. Nothing localizes on a general $a\\otimes x_0^{(1)}$. So there is no local site-1 $t$-algebra.\n\n**Step 2: SoV expansion instead.**\n- **Covectors.** In the companion frame, $x_0=e_1^T\\otimes e_1^T$, and the L=1 SoV covectors $\\langle x_\\mu|$ are constant ($z$- and $\\theta$-free; Rotation-e8-SoV Section 1).\n- **Test.** Are $\\langle x_\\mu|\\otimes e_1^T$ eigen-covectors of the L=2 untwisted $B(u)=T_{11}(u)\\,{\\rm qmin}_{12,12}(u+h)+T_{21}(u)\\,{\\rm qmin}_{12,13}(u+h)$?\n- **If so.** The site-1 rotation is $(e_1^T\\rho(g))\\otimes e_1^T=\\sum_\\mu c_\\mu(a,b)\\,\\langle x_\\mu|\\otimes e_1^T$, a sum over 8 SoV states with site 2 frozen at the vacuum. Here $c_\\mu(a,b)$ is the Section 3 formula.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* untwisted L=2 B(u) in the GT product basis (= companion frame) *)\nId3 = IdentityMatrix[3];\nBop2[v_] := TMf[Id3][1, 1][v] . qminor[Id3][{1, 2}, {1, 2}][v + hN] + TMf[Id3][2, 1][v] . qminor[Id3][{1, 2}, {1, 3}][v + hN];\n(* L=1 SoV covectors (companion frame, constants), from Rotation-e8-SoV Section 1, in gtpats order *)\ngtpats = {{{2}, {2, 1}}, {{2}, {1, 1}}, {{1}, {1, 1}}, {{2}, {2, 0}}, {{2}, {1, 0}}, {{2}, {0, 0}}, {{1}, {1, 0}}, {{1}, {0, 0}}};\nuv = UnitVector[d1, #] &;\nxL1 = {uv[1], hN (uv[2] + uv[3]), 6 hN^2 uv[5], hN uv[2], 2 hN^2 uv[4], hN^3 (-3 uv[6] + 4 uv[7]), 9 hN^3 uv[6], 9 hN^4 uv[8]};\nBs = Table[Bop2[v], {v, {1/3, -2/7, 5/9, 11/13}}];\nbEig = Table[Module[{c = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[xL1[[m]], uv[1]]], devs},\n    devs = Table[With[{r = c . B}, Norm[r - ((r . c)/(c . c)) c]/Max[Norm[r], 10^-40]], {B, Bs}]; Max[N[devs]]], {m, 8}];\nchecks[\"x_mu ⊗ e1 are eigen-covectors of L=2 untwisted B (max dev)\"] = Max[bEig];\n(* their B-eigenvalues: roots in u *)\nbRoots = Table[Module[{c = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[xL1[[m]], uv[1]]], k, ev}, k = First[Ordering[Abs[c], -1]];\n    ev = Expand[(c . (TMf[Id3][1, 1][u] . qminor[Id3][{1, 2}, {1, 2}][u + hN] + TMf[Id3][2, 1][u] . qminor[Id3][{1, 2}, {1, 3}][u + hN]))[[k]]/c[[k]]];\n    Sort[u /. Solve[ev == 0, u]]], {m, 8}];\n{N[bEig, 3], Thread[gtpats -> (bRoots - thN[[1]])/hN]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
