  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* full L=2 SoV basis: left eigenvectors of the untwisted B, labelled by their 6 roots (in units of h, relative to θ1 and θ2) *)\nBpoly = Expand[Sum[Bop2[uS[[k]]] Product[(u - uS[[l]])/(uS[[k]] - uS[[l]]), {l, DeleteCases[Range[7], k]}], {k, 7}]];\nchecks[\"B(u) degree 6 and interpolation exact\"] = (Max[Exponent[Bpoly, u]] == 6) && (Union[Flatten[Expand[(Bpoly /. u -> 19/23) - Bop2[19/23]]]] === {0});\n{evB, vecB} = Eigensystem[Transpose[N[Bpoly /. u -> 3/11, prec]]];\nchecks[\"B simple spectrum (min gap)\"] = Min[Abs[Subtract @@@ Subsets[evB, {2}]]];\nrootsOf[c_] := Module[{k = First[Ordering[Abs[c], -1]], ev}, ev = Chop[Expand[(c . N[Bpoly, prec])[[k]]/c[[k]]], 10^-30];\n   Sort[Chop[u /. NSolve[ev == 0, u, WorkingPrecision -> 40], 10^-20]]];\nsovRoots = Table[rootsOf[c], {c, vecB}];\n(* split roots into site-1 and site-2 ladders: (x - θ_s)/h is an integer *)\nladderOf[r_] := Module[{t1 = (r - thN[[1]])/hN, t2 = (r - thN[[2]])/hN}, Which[Abs[t1 - Round[t1]] < 10^-15, {1, Round[t1]}, Abs[t2 - Round[t2]] < 10^-15, {2, Round[t2]}, True, {0, r}]];\nsovLab = Table[GatherBy[SortBy[ladderOf /@ rs, First], First], {rs, sovRoots}];\nsite2vac = Sort[Select[ladderOf /@ First[Select[sovRoots, True &, 1]], First[#] == 2 &]];\n{checks[\"B(u) degree 6 and interpolation exact\"], N[checks[\"B simple spectrum (min gap)\"], 3], Tally[Length /@ (Select[ladderOf /@ #, First[#] == 1 &] & /@ sovRoots)], Union[Map[Last, Select[ladderOf /@ #, First[#] == 2 &] & /@ sovRoots, {2}]]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
