  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* site-1 rotation in the companion frame: (e1^T rho(g)) ⊗ e1^T, generic g *)\nωg = {{-1/5, 2/7, -1/3}, {3/4, 1/6, -2/9}, {1/8, -3/5, 2/11}};\nρg = MatrixExp[N[Sum[ωg[[i, j]] Ee[i, j], {i, 3}, {j, 3}], prec]];\nΦsite1 = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[uv[1] . ρg, uv[1]]];\ncSoV = LinearSolve[Transpose[vecB], Φsite1];\ncheckExp = Norm[cSoV . vecB - Φsite1]/Norm[Φsite1];\nlab[m_] := {Sort[Map[Last, Select[ladderOf /@ sovRoots[[m]], First[#] == 1 &]]], Sort[Map[Last, Select[ladderOf /@ sovRoots[[m]], First[#] == 2 &]]]};\nsupp = Select[Range[64], Abs[cSoV[[#]]]/Max[Abs[cSoV]] > 10^-30 &];\nchecks[\"site-1 rotation: # SoV states in support\"] = Length[supp];\nchecks[\"site-1 rotation: site-2 roots in support\"] = Union[lab[#][[2]] & /@ supp];\n{N[checkExp, 3], Length[supp], Union[lab[#][[2]] & /@ supp], Tally[lab[#][[1]] & /@ supp]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
