  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the linear map K: L=1 SoV covector x_nu ⊗ e1  ->  L=2 SoV states, in normalized-wavefunction units (c_x N_x) *)\nKrow[ν_] := Module[{c = LinearSolve[Transpose[vecB], N[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[xL1[[ν]], uv[1]]], prec]] Nm}, Select[Table[{lab[m], c[[m]]}, {m, 64}], Abs[#[[2]]] > 10^-30 &]];\nKtab = Table[{gtpats[[ν]], {#[[1]], Rationalize[Chop[#[[2]]/(Krow[1][[1, 2]]), 10^-40], 10^-30]} & /@ Krow[ν]}, {ν, 8}];\n(* hence the 'site-1 wavefunction at L=2':  <x_nu ⊗ x0|Psi>/<x0|Psi> = sum_x K_{nu x} psi(x) *)\nwf1L2[B_, ν_] := Sum[With[{t = kx[[1]]}, kx[[2]] psi1[B, t[[1]]] If[t[[2]] == {-3, -2, -1}, 1, λ2[B]]], {kx, Krow[ν]}];\nchecks[\"K reproduces <x_nu ⊗ x0|Psi>/<x0|Psi> for all nu, B\"] = Max[Table[Abs[wf1L2[B, ν]/((Flatten[KroneckerProduct[xL1[[ν]], uv[1]]] . ketC[[B]])/(x0C . ketC[[B]])) - 1], {B, nS}, {ν, 8}]];\n{N[checks[\"K reproduces <x_nu ⊗ x0|Psi>/<x0|Psi> for all nu, B\"], 3], Ktab}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
