tyle=\"top:-17.016em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.016em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎬</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-18.158em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.016em;\"></span><span style=\"height:15.016em;width:0.8889em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.8889em\" height=\"15.016em\" style=\"width:0.8889em\" viewBox=\"0 0 888.89 15016\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M384 0 H504 V15016 H384z M384 0 H504 V15016 H384z\"/></svg></span></span><span style=\"top:-33.166em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:17.016em;\"></span><span class=\"delimsizinginner delim-size4\"><span>⎫</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:16.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:17.4626em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
