      {
       "data": "Out[206]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\langle\\!\\lvert \\text{F0 = ($\\delta$\\_\\{$\\theta$s-2h\\}, $\\delta$\\_\\{$\\theta$s\\}) reproduces x0: det6[F0]/Psi\\_Q const} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.\\times 10^{-51} \\\\\n  &,\\text{$\\Omega$\\_w$\\otimes$$\\Omega$\\_w (companion) $\\propto$ det6[F\\_vac,w]/Psi\\_Q} \\\\\n  &\\to 0.\\times 10^{-50} \\\\\n  &,\\text{L=1 vacuum q's found, degrees (0,1,2)} \\\\\n  &\\to \\mathrm{True} \\\\\n  &,\\text{$\\Omega$\\_w$\\otimes$e1: ladder1 = L=2 vac Q's, ladder2 = F0} \\\\\n  &\\to 91.12969026550718471964{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  &{\\color{gray}\\vdots}5590873911405309527221987822777 \\\\\n  &,\\text{$\\Omega$\\_w$\\otimes$e1: ladder1 = L=1 vac Q's, ladder2 = F0} \\\\\n  &\\to 141.10411526627724105250{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  &{\\color{gray}\\vdots}36815719430287689342{\\color{gray}\\vdots} \\\\\n  &{\\color{gray}\\vdots}0841199135\\rvert\\!\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}",
