  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* reconstruct the covector phi_F with phi_F.Psi_B = det6[B,F]/Psi_Q(x0) * <x0|Psi_B>, and look at it as an 8x8 (site1 x site2) matrix *)\nketMatC = Transpose[ketC]; ketInvC = Inverse[ketMatC];\nphiOf[F_] := Table[det6[B, F]/psiQ[B] (x0C . ketC[[B]]), {B, nS}] . ketInvC;\nsvMat[φ_] := SingularValueList[Partition[φ, d1], 8, Tolerance -> 0];\nsite2Factor[φ_] := Module[{M = Partition[φ, d1], sv}, Normalize[First[SingularValueDecomposition[M][[3]]\\[Transpose]]]];\nφmix = phiOf[FmixL2]; φF0 = phiOf[F0]; φvv = phiOf[Fvac];\n{N[svMat[φF0]/svMat[φF0][[1]], 3], N[svMat[φmix]/svMat[φmix][[1]], 3], N[svMat[φvv]/svMat[φvv][[1]], 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
