  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* unknown ladder-2 bra data: f2v[i, m] = F_i(θ2 + m h), i = 1,2, m = -2..1; ladder 1 = w-vacuum Q's (L=2) *)\nunk = Flatten[Table[f2v[i, m], {i, 2}, {m, -2, 1}]];\nFlad2 = Function[{i, x}, If[i > 2, 0, Sum[If[Abs[x - (thN[[2]] + m hN)] < 10^-30, f2v[i, m], 0], {m, -2, 1}]]];\n(* det6L is a polynomial in the unknowns; build it once per state *)\nd6sym = Table[Expand[det6L[B, {Fvac, Flad2}]/psiQ[B]], {B, nS}];\nresid[vals_, lam_] := (d6sym /. Thread[unk -> vals]) - lam TA;\n(* least squares: minimize |resid|^2/|TA|^2 over the 8 values and lambda, from the F0 start and random starts *)\nobj[vals_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &), lam_?NumericQ] := Total[Abs[resid[vals, lam]]^2]/Total[Abs[TA]^2];\nstartF0 = Flatten[Table[If[(i == 1 && m == -2) || (i == 2 && m == 0), 1, 0], {i, 2}, {m, -2, 1}]];\nlam0 = With[{d = d6sym /. Thread[unk -> startF0]}, (d . TA)/(TA . TA)];\nSeedRandom[7];\nfits = Table[Module[{st = If[k == 1, startF0, startF0 + RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 8]], sol},\n    sol = Quiet[FindMinimum[obj[Array[vv, 8], lv], Join[Transpose[{Array[vv, 8], st}], {{lv, lam0}}], WorkingPrecision -> 40, MaxIterations -> 2000]];\n    {sol[[1]], Array[vv, 8] /. sol[[2]], lv /. sol[[2]]}], {k, 6}];\nbestFit = First[SortBy[fits, First]];\n{N[Sort[fits[[All, 1]]], 3], N[bestFit[[2]], 6]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
