  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Gauss-Newton on all 64 equations, unknowns = 8 ladder-2 values + lambda; gauge directions handled by PseudoInverse; fixed 60-digit arithmetic (no precision tracking) *)\nresV[vals_, lam_] := (d6sym /. Thread[unk -> vals]) - lam TA;\njacSym = Transpose[Join[Transpose[D[d6sym, {unk}]], {-TA}]];   (* 64 x 9 *)\ngnStep[{vals_, lam_}] := Module[{J = jacSym /. Thread[unk -> vals], r = resV[vals, lam], dx}, dx = -PseudoInverse[J, Tolerance -> 10^-30] . r; {vals + dx[[1 ;; 8]], lam + dx[[9]]}];\n{gnIter, gnRes, svJ} = Block[{$MinPrecision = 60, $MaxPrecision = 60},\n   Module[{it = NestList[gnStep, {SetPrecision[bestFit[[2]], 60], SetPrecision[bestFit[[3]], 60]}, 10]},\n    {it, Table[Norm[resV @@ s]/Norm[TA], {s, it}], SingularValueList[jacSym /. Thread[unk -> Last[it][[1]]], 9, Tolerance -> 0]}]];\nladder2Sol = Last[gnIter];\nchecks[\"site-1 vacuum Ω_w⊗e1 = det6L[{F_vac,w ; F_lad2}]/Psi_Q (Gauss-Newton residual)\"] = Last[gnRes];\n{N[gnRes, 3], N[svJ/svJ[[1]], 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
