  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* gauge-fixed ladder-2 data: F1 -> F1/F1(θ2-2h); F2 -> (F2 - c F1) with F2(θ2-2h) = 0, normalized at its largest entry *)\ngaugeFix[v_] := Module[{a = v[[1 ;; 4]], b = v[[5 ;; 8]]}, a = a/a[[1]]; b = b - b[[1]] a; b = b/b[[First[Ordering[Abs[b], -1]]]]; Chop[{a, b}, 10^-35]];\nladFix = gaugeFix[ladder2Sol[[1]]];\nN[ladFix, 10]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
