  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 5 (partly RETRACTED; see 6b).**\n- **Still valid.** $F_0=(F_1=\\delta_{\\theta_s-2h},\\ F_2=\\delta_{\\theta_s})$ on both ladders reproduces $x_0$ ($10^{-51}$).\n- **Still valid.** Per-ladder brackets reproduce $\\Omega_w\\otimes\\Omega_w$ and $x_0$.\n- **Still valid.** Naive mixing (ladder 1 = w-vacuum Q's, ladder 2 = $F_0$) gives $A\\otimes e_1+A'\\otimes e_2$, not $\\Omega_w\\otimes e_1$.\n- **RETRACTED.** The \"exact solution\" for ladder-2 data $F^{(2)}$ ($10^{-44}$), and the \"2-parameter family\" around it, were the trivial branch: $\\lambda\\approx0$ and $\\det_6\\equiv0$, with $F_2\\propto F_1$ (the gauge direction). See 6b.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (a) how many combinations of the 8 ladder-2 numbers does det6L actually depend on? rank of d(det6L)/d(F^(2)) over the 64 states, at random F^(2) *)\nSeedRandom[17];\nrankLad2 = Table[MatrixRank[(D[d6sym, {unk}] /. Thread[unk -> RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 8, WorkingPrecision -> 60]]), Tolerance -> 10^-35], {3}];\n(* (b) robustness: redo the whole fit at a second twist w' *)\nw2N = {7/4, -2/5, 9/7};\nGPw2 = Simplify[Paux . Gc[ws] . Inverse[Paux]] /. Join[Thread[zs -> zN], Thread[ws -> w2N]];\nrOm2 = {(w[1] - z[1])/(w[1] - z[2]), ((w[1] - z[1]) (-w[2] + z[1]) (z[2] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (w[2] - z[3])), ((w[1] - z[2]) (-w[2] + z[2]) (z[1] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (-w[2] + z[3]))} /. Join[Thread[zs -> zN], Thread[ws -> w2N]];\nΩ1b = First[{UnitVector[d1, 1]} . MatrixExp[rOm2[[1]] Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[rOm2[[2]] Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[rOm2[[3]] Ee[2, 3]]]; Ω2b = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1b, Ω1b]];\ntW2 = Table[tPoly[GPw2, a], {a, 3}];\ntauVac2 = Table[Expand[(Ω2b . tW2[[a]])[[kOm]]/Ω2b[[kOm]]], {a, 3}];\nqdVac2 = Table[solveQ[opDir, N[tauVac2, prec], w2N[[i]], -1], {i, 3}];\nFvac2 = Function[{i, x}, N[w2N[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (qdVac2[[i]] /. X -> x)];\nchecks[\"w': Ω_w'⊗Ω_w' (companion) ∝ det6L[{Fvac',Fvac'}]/Psi_Q\"] = constQ[Table[(Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ωc[w2N], Ωc[w2N]]] . ketC[[B]])/(x0C . ketC[[B]])/(det6L[B, {Fvac2, Fvac2}]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]];\nTA2 = Table[(Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ωc[w2N], uv[1]]] . ketC[[B]])/(x0C . ketC[[B]]), {B, nS}];\nd6sym2 = Table[Expand[det6L[B, {Fvac2, Flad2}]/psiQ[B]], {B, nS}];\nresV2[vals_, lam_] := (d6sym2 /. Thread[unk -> vals]) - lam TA2;\njac2 = Transpose[Join[Transpose[D[d6sym2, {unk}]], {-TA2}]];\nfit2 = Block[{$MinPrecision = 60, $MaxPrecision = 60}, Module[{best = {Infinity}, st, it, r},\n    Do[st = {SetPrecision[startF0 + If[k == 1, 0, RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 8]], 60], 1};\n     st[[2]] = With[{d = d6sym2 /. Thread[unk -> st[[1]]]}, (d . TA2)/(TA2 . TA2)];\n     it = Nest[Function[s, Module[{J = jac2 /. Thread[unk -> s[[1]]], dx}, dx = -PseudoInverse[J, Tolerance -> 10^-30] . resV2 @@ s; {s[[1]] + dx[[1 ;; 8]], s[[2]] + dx[[9]]}]], st, 40];\n     r = Norm[resV2 @@ it]/Norm[TA2]; If[r < best[[1]], best = {r, it}], {k, 8}]; best]];\nchecks[\"w': Ω_w'⊗e1 = det6L[{Fvac', F^(2)}]/Psi_Q (best residual)\"] = fit2[[1]];\n{rankLad2, N[checks[\"w': Ω_w'⊗Ω_w' (companion) ∝ det6L[{Fvac',Fvac'}]/Psi_Q\"], 3], N[fit2[[1]], 3]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"164\" data-out-n=\"2096\" data-sub-idx=\"19\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"33\" data-sub-start=\"23\" data-sub-end=\"23\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[2096]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRce1xsZWZ0XHs2LDYsNlxyaWdodFx9LDAuXHRpbWVzIDEwXnstNTF9LDEuMDNcdGltZXMgMTBeey01Nn1ccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2141em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">{</span></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">51</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.03</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">56</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[2096]= \\left\\{\\left\\{6,6,6\\right\\},0.\\times 10^{-51},1.03\\times 10^{-56}\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
