       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"FindMinimum::lsbrak: Unable to bracket a minimum along the direction {-2.149602603317056780168515834613230619449 10  , -1.375223329784175953953122393057821972611 10  , 8.920591350787580250671938804341210843380 10  , 2.401922012523905927332694427880128593396 10  } from the point {-3.037924103701875177256451541725225083230, -1.943523378838184873508012193146644211906, 2.975292226851494591008682202443429890913, 0.7124885796344846914628111584893967488495}.\\nFindMinimum::lsbrak: Unable to bracket a minimum along the direction {-2.149602603317056780168515834613230619449 10  , -1.375223329784175953953122393057821972611 10  , 8.920591350787580250671938804341210843380 10  , 2.401922012523905927332694427880128593396 10  } from the point {-3.037924103701875177256451541725225083230, -1.943523378838184873508012193146644211906, 2.975292226851494591008682202443429890913, 0.7124885796344846914628111584893967488495}.\\nFindMinimum::lsbrak: Unable to bracket a minimum along the direction {-2.149602603317056780168515834613230619449 10  , -1.375223329784175953953122393057821972611 10  , 8.920591350787580250671938804341210843380 10  , 2.401922012523905927332694427880128593396 10  } from the point {-3.037924103701875177256451541725225083230, -1.943523378838184873508012193146644211906, 2.975292226851494591008682202443429890913, 0.7124885796344846914628111584893967488495}.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of FindMinimum::lsbrak will be suppressed during this calculation.\\nReplaceAll::reps: {p1, 1.90853} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.\\nReplaceAll::reps: {p2, -1.93278} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.\\nReplaceAll::reps: {p3, 0.726493} is neither a list of replacement rules nor a valid dispatch table, and so cannot be used for replacing.\\nGeneral::stop: Further output of ReplaceAll::reps will be suppressed during this calculation.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
