   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 7. Direction 1: free bra data on both ladders (plan: `site1-Qform/1-free-ladder-data.md`)\n- **Unknowns.** $F^{(s)}=(F_1,F_2)$ at $\\theta_s+mh$, $m=-2..1$, for $s=1,2$: 16 numbers. There are 3 gauges per ladder, so 10 effective unknowns.\n- **Equations.** $\\det_6^{\\rm per\\text{-}ladder}[Q_B;F^{(1)},F^{(2)}]/\\Psi_Q^B(x_0)=T_B$ for all 64 $B$, with **$\\lambda=1$ fixed** so that the trivial branch is excluded.\n- **Speed-up.** Each row is linear in one ladder's $F_1$ or $F_2$, so basis rows are precomputed once. The Jacobian comes from the adjugate.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* basis rows: Rb[B, s, ij, m] = per-ladder row (i,j; s) with F_i = δ at θ_s + m h *)\ndeltaF[s_, i_, m_] := Function[{ii, x}, If[ii == i && Abs[x - (thN[[s]] + m hN)] < 10^-30, 1, 0]];\nRb = Table[N[rowLad[B, deltaF[s, ij[[1]], m], ij, s], prec], {B, nS}, {s, nL}, {ij, prsL1}, {m, -2, 1}];   (* 64 x 2 x 3 x 4 x 6 *)\npsiQv = Table[psiQ[B], {B, nS}];\n(* params p: {F1^(1)(4), F2^(1)(4), F1^(2)(4), F2^(2)(4)} *)\nrowsOf[B_, p_] := Join @@ Table[With[{f1 = p[[8 (s - 1) + 1 ;; 8 (s - 1) + 4]], f2 = p[[8 (s - 1) + 5 ;; 8 (s - 1) + 8]]}, {f1 . Rb[[B, s, 1]], f1 . Rb[[B, s, 2]], f2 . Rb[[B, s, 3]]}], {s, nL}];\ndetP[p_] := Table[Det[rowsOf[B, p]]/psiQv[[B]], {B, nS}];\n(* Jacobian via the adjugate: d det = sum_r (adj^T)_r . d row_r *)\njacP[p_] := Table[Module[{M = rowsOf[B, p], adjT, g = ConstantArray[0, 16]},\n    adjT = Det[M] Transpose[Inverse[M]];\n    Do[With[{off = 8 (s - 1), rs = 3 (s - 1)}, \n       g[[off + 1 ;; off + 4]] += Rb[[B, s, 1]] . adjT[[rs + 1]] + Rb[[B, s, 2]] . adjT[[rs + 2]];\n       g[[off + 5 ;; off + 8]] += Rb[[B, s, 3]] . adjT[[rs + 3]]], {s, nL}];\n    g/psiQv[[B]]], {B, nS}];\n(* natural data as parameter vectors *)\nvecOf[F_, s_] := Join[Table[N[F[1, thN[[s]] + m hN], prec], {m, -2, 1}], Table[N[F[2, thN[[s]] + m hN], prec], {m, -2, 1}]];\npW = Join[vecOf[Fvac, 1], vecOf[Fvac, 2]]; p0 = Join[vecOf[F0, 1], vecOf[F0, 2]]; pWF0 = Join[vecOf[Fvac, 1], vecOf[F0, 2]];\nchecks[\"7: fast det = det6L for (Fw,Fw), (F0,F0), (Fw,F0)\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[detP[pp[[1]]] - Table[det6L[B, pp[[2]]]/psiQ[B], {B, nS}]]]/Max[Abs[detP[pp[[1]]]]], {pp, {{pW, {Fvac, Fvac}}, {p0, {F0, F0}}, {pWF0, {Fvac, F0}}}}]];\nchecks[\"7: Jacobian = finite differences\"] = Module[{pr = pW + RandomReal[{-1, 1}/10, 16], d = 10^-25, fd}, fd = Transpose[Table[(detP[pr + d UnitVector[16, k]] - detP[pr - d UnitVector[16, k]])/(2 d), {k, 16}]]; Max[Abs[Flatten[fd - jacP[pr]]]]/Max[Abs[Flatten[fd]]]];\nN[KeyTake[checks, Select[Keys[checks], StringStartsQ[#, \"7:\"] &]], 3]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em;white-space:pre-wrap\">Power::infy: Infinite expression -- encountered.                                  0.</div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
