  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result 8 (Direction 2): negative.**\n- **Framework.** General per-pole, per-column weights $W[k,f,p]$ (36 numbers) cover every polynomial insertion, including column-dependent ones. The natural weights reproduce $\\Omega_w\\otimes\\Omega_w$ and $x_0$ ($10^{-50}$), and the Jacobian is checked.\n- **Stage 1: kill masks.** None of the 64 ladder-2 masks gives a state-independent ratio (best spread 3.5).\n- **Stage 2, $w$ only.** The residual descends slowly, to 0.036 after 1800 steps. But the resulting $W$ transfers neither to $w'$ (residual 0.996) nor to $x_0$ with $F_0$ (0.41): it is overfitting about 31 effective parameters.\n- **Stage 2, joint.** One $W$ for two real twists $w$ and $w''=(9/4,4/3,5/7)$, with $\\lambda=1$ at $w$ and a projective (scale-free) comparison at $w''$.\n  - The fit converges to a **firm minimum of 0.121**: it is unchanged from step about 1250 to 3000, with $w$ part about 0.10 and $w''$ angle about 0.10.\n  - The weights stay bounded, between 0.0006 and 4.8 times the natural ones.\n- **Bookkeeping.** An earlier joint fit with $\\lambda'$ free slid to a near-trivial branch at $w'$ ($\\|\\det\\|/\\|T\\|=0.04$), and the complex-$w'$ projective fit stalled because the data were complex. Both are superseded by the real $w''$ fit.\n- **Conclusion.** No $w$-independent insertion, polynomial or general per-pole/per-column, in the $6\\times6$ bracket determinant with the natural bra data gives $\\langle\\Omega_w\\otimes e_1^T|\\Psi\\rangle$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Direction 3: a short sum of determinants (plan: `site1-Qform/3-sum-of-dets.md`)\nThis is a linear fit, $T_B\\approx\\sum_k\\alpha_kD_k(B)$, over a dictionary of per-ladder $6\\times6$ determinants $D_k=\\det_6[F^{(1)}_k,F^{(2)}_k]/\\Psi_Q$:\n- ladder-1 data in {$w$-vacuum Q's ($L=2$), $L=1$ vacuum Q's, 16 delta types $(F_1,F_2)=(\\delta_{m_1},\\delta_{m_2})$};\n- ladder-2 data in {$w$-vacuum Q's, 16 delta types}.\n\n**Meaningful only if sparse.** It counts only if a few atoms ($\\le3$) reproduce $T$ exactly and the same atoms work at $w''$ with refitted $\\alpha$'s.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ladder data as 8-vectors (F1 at m=-2..1, F2 at m=-2..1) *)\ndeltaVec[m1_, m2_] := Join[UnitVector[4, m1 + 3], UnitVector[4, m2 + 3]];\nlad1Opts = Join[{\"Fw\" -> vecOf[Fvac, 1], \"Fw(L1)\" -> vecOf[Fv1, 1]}, Flatten[Table[(\"d\" <> ToString[{m1, m2}]) -> N[deltaVec[m1, m2], prec], {m1, -2, 1}, {m2, -2, 1}]]];\nlad2Opts = Join[{\"Fw\" -> vecOf[Fvac, 2]}, Flatten[Table[(\"d\" <> ToString[{m1, m2}]) -> N[deltaVec[m1, m2], prec], {m1, -2, 1}, {m2, -2, 1}]]];\natomVec[o1_, o2_] := detP[Join[o1[[2]], o2[[2]]]];\n{tAtoms, atoms} = AbsoluteTiming[Flatten[Table[{o1[[1]] <> \" | \" <> o2[[1]], atomVec[o1, o2]}, {o1, lad1Opts}, {o2, lad2Opts}], 1]];\natoms = Select[atoms, Norm[#[[2]]] > 10^-40 &];   (* drop identically-zero dets *)\nAdict = Transpose[atoms[[All, 2]]];\nlsRes[cols_] := Module[{A = Adict[[All, cols]], c}, c = LeastSquares[A, TA]; {Norm[A . c - TA]/Norm[TA], c}];\n(* Stage A: ladder 1 = Fw only *)\nidxA = Flatten[Position[atoms[[All, 1]], s_String /; StringStartsQ[s, \"Fw | \"]]];\nresA = lsRes[idxA];\n(* rank of the full dictionary (overcompleteness check) *)\nrkDict = MatrixRank[Adict, Tolerance -> 10^-35];\n{N[tAtoms, 3], Length[atoms], rkDict, Length[idxA], N[resA[[1]], 3], MatrixRank[Adict[[All, idxA]], Tolerance -> 10^-35]}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"178\" data-out-n=\"2247\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"54\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[2247]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezIuMTMwNjI3LDU2LDU1LDcsMC42OTYsN1xyaWdodFx9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">2.130627</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">56</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.696</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
