  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* dictionary results recorded above (natural atoms: rank 55, full-fit residual 9.6e-4; OMP slow). Polarized span is full rank (64), so 'a sum exists' is trivial;\n   the question is the minimal number of terms. Two free per-ladder dets: T = D[pa] + D[pb], lambda fixed (absorbed into F1 scales) *)\nresolvedNat = {resA[[1]], resAll[[1]], rkDict};\nres2[q_] := detP[q[[1 ;; 16]]] + detP[q[[17 ;; 32]]] - TA;\njac2D[q_] := Join[jacP[q[[1 ;; 16]]], jacP[q[[17 ;; 32]]], 2];\nlm2[q0_, nIt_] := Block[{$MinPrecision = 60, $MaxPrecision = 60}, Module[{q = SetPrecision[q0, 60], mu = 10^-3, r, J, dq, qn, rn, rc, traj = {}},\n    rc = Norm[res2[q]]/Norm[TA];\n    Do[r = res2[q]; J = jac2D[q];\n     dq = -LinearSolve[ConjugateTranspose[J] . J + mu IdentityMatrix[32], ConjugateTranspose[J] . r];\n     qn = q + dq; rn = Norm[res2[qn]]/Norm[TA];\n     If[rn < rc, q = qn; rc = rn; mu = Max[mu/3, 10^-40], mu = 10 mu];\n     If[Mod[it, 50] == 0, AppendTo[traj, rc]];\n     If[rc < 10^-45, Break[]], {it, nIt}];\n    {rc, q, traj}]];\n(* starts: (Fw,F0) for term a (scaled to fit), random term b small; and fully random *)\nhalfScale[p_, frac_] := Module[{d = detP[p], a2, q = p}, a2 = frac (Conjugate[d] . TA)/(Conjugate[d] . d); q[[1 ;; 4]] = Sqrt[a2] q[[1 ;; 4]]; q];\nSeedRandom[601];\nst2 = Join[\n   Table[Join[halfScale[pWF0, 1], halfScale[SetPrecision[RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 16], 60], 1/10]], {3}],\n   Table[Join[halfScale[SetPrecision[RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 16], 60], 1/2], halfScale[SetPrecision[RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 16], 60], 1/2]], {5}]];\nruns2 = Table[lm2[s, 300], {s, st2}];\nbest2 = First[SortBy[runs2, First]];\nchecks[\"9: two free per-ladder dets: best residual\"] = best2[[1]];\nchecks[\"9: two dets: ||D_a||, ||D_b|| / ||T|| at best\"] = {Norm[detP[best2[[2, 1 ;; 16]]]], Norm[detP[best2[[2, 17 ;; 32]]]]}/Norm[TA];\nN[{resolvedNat, Sort[runs2[[All, 1]]], best2[[3]], checks[\"9: two dets: ||D_a||, ||D_b|| / ||T|| at best\"]}, 3]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"485294\" data-output-id=\"179\" data-out-n=\"2259\" data-sub-idx=\"13\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"55\" data-sub-start=\"24\" data-sub-end=\"24\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[2259]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-line-broken=\"1\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:6em;vertical-align:-2.75em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.75em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.84em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.25em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0.696</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.000957</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">55.</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0.117</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.185</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.237</span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.246</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.280</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.346</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.358</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.532</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0.169</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.156</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.147</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.136</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.123</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.117</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.91em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">12.8</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">13.0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.75em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[2259]= \\begin{aligned}\n  &\\left\\{\\left\\{0.696,0.000957,55.\\,\\right\\},\\left\\{0.117,0.185,0.237 \\right. \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. \\left. ,0.246,0.280,0.346,0.358,0.532\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\left\\{0.169,0.156,0.147,0.136,0.123,0.117\\right\\} \\right. \\\\\n  &\\left. ,\\left\\{12.8,13.0\\right\\}\\right\\}\n\\end{aligned}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "8e0b4851-ca97-4b04-a093-7dfd0e18bcad"
