   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Two L=1-type sums.** The bra coefficients on the $8\\times2$ grid (site-1 triple $\\times$ site-2 $\\in\\{\\rm vac,\\{2|20\\}\\}$) have rank $\\le2$, so\n$$\\frac{\\langle\\Phi|\\Psi_B\\rangle}{\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle}=\\sum_{x_1}\\varphi^{(1)}_{x_1}\\,\\psi^{(1)}_{x_1}(B)+\\lambda_2(B)\\sum_{x_1}\\varphi^{(2)}_{x_1}\\,\\psi^{(1)}_{x_1}(B),\\qquad \\varphi^{(i)}=c\\cdot K^{(i)} .$$\nEach group is an L=1-type SoV sum over the 8 site-1 triples. At L=1 such a sum is a determinant of brackets when the coefficient vector is a **rotation**, i.e. lies on the minimal nilpotent orbit (rank-1 traceless $X(\\varphi)$, Rotation-e8-SoV §3). So: is $\\varphi^{(i)}(c(a,b))$ again on the orbit?\n\nThe equivariant map $\\varphi\\mapsto X(\\varphi)\\in\\mathfrak{sl}_3$ is rebuilt here in this notebook's conventions ($x_0=e_1^T$) by solving the equivariance condition linearly.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* equivariant linear map X: GT-basis covectors (8-dim, acting by φ.Ee[a,b]) -> 3x3 matrices; solve X(φ.(E_ab - δ_ab)) = ε [X(φ), e_ab^T or e_ab] linearly; the variant with a 1-dim null space is the right one *)\nxvars = Flatten[Table[xx[ν, p, q], {ν, 8}, {p, 3}, {q, 3}]];\nXof[φ_] := Sum[φ[[ν]] Table[xx[ν, p, q], {p, 3}, {q, 3}], {ν, 8}];\nEtr[a_, b_] := Ee[a, b] - KroneckerDelta[a, b] IdentityMatrix[d1];\nequivEqs[ε_, tr_] := Flatten[Table[Xof[UnitVector[8, k] . Etr[a, b]] - ε (Xof[UnitVector[8, k]] . tr[ee[a, b]] - tr[ee[a, b]] . Xof[UnitVector[8, k]]), {k, 8}, {a, 3}, {b, 3}]];\nnullDims = Table[{ε, tr, Length[NullSpace[Table[Coefficient[e, v], {e, equivEqs[ε, tr]}, {v, xvars}]]]}, {ε, {1, -1}}, {tr, {Identity, Transpose}}] // Flatten[#, 1] &;\ngood = First[Select[nullDims, Last[#] == 1 &]];\nXsol = First[NullSpace[Table[Coefficient[e, v], {e, equivEqs[good[[1]], good[[2]]]}, {v, xvars}]]];\nXmat[φ_] := Xof[φ] /. Thread[xvars -> Xsol];\n(* coefficient vectors over the SoV covectors x_ν (trip/gtpats order) are converted to GT-basis covectors first: φ = cvec.xL1 *)\nXc[cvec_] := Xmat[cvec . xL1];\nrank1dev[M_] := With[{s = SingularValueList[N[M, 30]]}, If[Length[s] < 2, 0, s[[2]]/s[[1]]]];\n(* sanity: X(x0 = e1) is rank 1 and traceless; X(cL1) (a generic rotation) is rank 1; a random c is not *)\nchecks[\"X(e1) rank 1, traceless\"] = {rank1dev[Xmat[UnitVector[8, 1]]], Tr[Xmat[UnitVector[8, 1]]]};\nchecks[\"X(cL1) rank 1 (rotation, 2nd/1st singular value)\"] = rank1dev[Xc[cL1]];\nchecks[\"X(random c) rank (2nd/1st singular value, should be O(1))\"] = rank1dev[Xc[cRnd]];\nStringRiffle[{nullDims, Xmat[UnitVector[8, 1]], N[checks[\"X(cL1) rank 1 (rotation, 2nd/1st singular value)\"], 3], N[checks[\"X(random c) rank (2nd/1st singular value, should be O(1))\"], 3]}, \" | \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"368062\" data-output-id=\"24\" data-out-n=\"296\" data-sub-idx=\"16\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"62\" data-sub-start=\"16\" data-sub-end=\"16\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[296]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7XHtcezEsIElkZW50aXR5LCAxXH0sIFx7MSwgVHJhbnNwb3NlLCAwXH0sIFx7LTEsIElkZW50aXR5LCAwXH0sIFx7LTEsIFRyYW5zcG9zZSwgMVx9XH0gfCBce1x7MCwgMCwgMFx9LCBcezAsIDAsIDBcfSwgXHszLCAwLCAwXH1cfSB8IDAgfCAwLjA5Mjh9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">{{1, Identity, 1}, {1, Transpose, 0}, {-1, Identity, 0}, {-1, Transpose, 1}} | {{0, 0, 0}, {0, 0, 0}, {3, 0, 0}} | 0 | 0.0928</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[296]= \\text{\\{\\{1, Identity, 1\\}, \\{1, Transpose, 0\\}, \\{-1, Identity, 0\\}, \\{-1, Transpose, 1\\}\\} | \\{\\{0, 0, 0\\}, \\{0, 0, 0\\}, \\{3, 0, 0\\}\\} | 0 | 0.0928}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
