  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Bracket product form in the $(\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda_1)$ variables.** A ladder-1 bracket is $\\langle Q^jF\\rangle=\\sum_mF(m)v_j(\\theta_1+mh)=v_j(-3)[F(-3)+\\alpha m_F]+v_j(-2)[F(-2)+\\beta m_F]$ with $m_F=F(-1)+\\lambda_1F(0)$. Hence a $\\det_2$ of two brackets over $\\det_2[v(-2),v(-3)]$ is affine in $(\\alpha,\\beta)$ plus $\\lambda_1\\times$(linear in $\\alpha,\\beta$), with **no** $\\alpha\\beta$ term, and a third bracket over $v_1(-1)$ is $g_0+g_1\\lambda_1$. So a Cauchy–Binet-type object (bra wavefunction $\\det_2[F_1,F_2]\\,G$) has the product form\n$$P=\\big[a_0+a_1\\alpha+a_2\\beta+\\lambda_1(b_1\\alpha+b_2\\beta)\\big]\\,(g_0+g_1\\lambda_1).$$\nFor a group polynomial $P=p_0+p_\\alpha\\alpha+p_\\beta\\beta+\\lambda_1(q_0+q_\\alpha\\alpha+q_\\beta\\beta)+\\lambda_1^2(r_\\alpha\\alpha+r_\\beta\\beta)$ this is equivalent to the two conditions\n$$q_\\alpha p_0q_0-q_0^2p_\\alpha-p_0^2r_\\alpha=0,\\qquad q_\\beta p_0q_0-q_0^2p_\\beta-p_0^2r_\\beta=0 .$$\nTested on L=1 rotations ($K=1$), on the two L=2 groups, and on random (non-rotation) covectors.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* group polynomial of an 8-vector φ over the trip order: P = sum φ_x psiSym_x *)\ngroupPoly[φ_] := Expand[φ . psiSym];\ncoefs[P_] := Module[{p0, pa, pb, q0, qa, qb, ra, rb}, {p0, pa, pb} = {Coefficient[P, {λ1, α, β}, 0] /. {α -> 0, β -> 0, λ1 -> 0}, Coefficient[Coefficient[P, λ1, 0], α], Coefficient[Coefficient[P, λ1, 0], β]};\n  {q0, qa, qb} = {Coefficient[P, λ1, 1] /. {α -> 0, β -> 0}, Coefficient[Coefficient[P, λ1, 1], α], Coefficient[Coefficient[P, λ1, 1], β]};\n  {ra, rb} = {Coefficient[Coefficient[P, λ1, 2], α], Coefficient[Coefficient[P, λ1, 2], β]};\n  {p0, pa, pb, q0, qa, qb, ra, rb}];\nprodCond[φ_] := Module[{p0, pa, pb, q0, qa, qb, ra, rb}, {p0, pa, pb, q0, qa, qb, ra, rb} = coefs[groupPoly[φ]];\n  (* normalized: divide by the typical size of the terms *)\n  {qa p0 q0 - q0^2 pa - p0^2 ra, qb p0 q0 - q0^2 pb - p0^2 rb}/Max[Abs[{qa p0 q0, q0^2 pa, p0^2 ra, qb p0 q0, q0^2 pb, p0^2 rb}]]];\nrots = Prepend[Table[rotC[ω], {ω, ωs}], cL1];\nSeedRandom[5]; rnds = Table[RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 8, WorkingPrecision -> prec], {3}];\nprodTab = {\n  \"L=1 rotation (K=1)\" -> Max[Abs[prodCond /@ rots]],\n  \"L=2 group 1 (c.Kvac), rotations\" -> Max[Abs[prodCond[#[[1]]] & /@ φgrp /@ rots]],\n  \"L=2 group 2 (c.K20), rotations\" -> Max[Abs[prodCond[#[[2]]] & /@ φgrp /@ rots]],\n  \"random c (control)\" -> Max[Abs[prodCond /@ rnds]],\n  \"random c, group 1 (control)\" -> Max[Abs[prodCond[#[[1]]] & /@ φgrp /@ rnds]]};\nchecks[\"product-form conditions (L=1 rot | grp1 | grp2 | random | random grp1)\"] = N[prodTab[[All, 2]], 3];\nStringRiffle[ToString[N[#, 3]] & /@ prodTab, \" | \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"368062\" data-output-id=\"26\" data-out-n=\"315\" data-sub-idx=\"8\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"65\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[315]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7TD0xIHJvdGF0aW9uIChLPTEpIC0+IDIuNDIgfCBMPTIgZ3JvdXAgMSAoYy5LdmFjKSwgcm90YXRpb25zIC0+IDEuMjkgfCBMPTIgZ3JvdXAgMiAoYy5LMjApLCByb3RhdGlvbnMgLT4gMS4wMCB8IHJhbmRvbSBjIChjb250cm9sKSAtPiAyLjU1IHwgcmFuZG9tIGMsIGdyb3VwIDEgKGNvbnRyb2wpIC0+IDEuMDZ9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L=1 rotation (K=1) -&gt; 2.42 | L=2 group 1 (c.Kvac), rotations -&gt; 1.29 | L=2 group 2 (c.K20), rotations -&gt; 1.00 | random c (control) -&gt; 2.55 | random c, group 1 (control) -&gt; 1.06</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[315]= \\text{L=1 rotation (K=1) -> 2.42 | L=2 group 1 (c.Kvac), rotations -> 1.29 | L=2 group 2 (c.K20), rotations -> 1.00 | random c (control) -> 2.55 | random c, group 1 (control) -> 1.06}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "706000b2-dc40-411b-8e57-e855c4ee93b9"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Control: the L=1 determinant formula on ladder 1 of an L=2 state.** At L=1 (Rotation-e8-SoV §10d–10e), $\\Omega_wM(y_1,\\infty)\\cdot\\Psi_B\\propto\\det N[Q_B,Q_{{\\rm vac},w}]\\cdot\\det_2^{su(2)}[Q_B;y_1]/(\\Psi_Q\\cdot{\\rm minor}_2)$. The same brackets, restricted to the ladder-1 poles $\\theta_1-nh$ ($n=0,1,2$) and fed the L=2 dual Q's, define a function of the L=2 state. Questions: (a) is it in the span of the 8 site-1 wavefunctions $\\psi^{(1)}$ (i.e. a polynomial in $\\alpha,\\beta,\\lambda_1$)? (b) is the fitted coefficient vector a rotation? (c) does it match group 1, $c\\cdot K^{\\rm vac}$, for the rotation $g=M(w)M(y_1,\\infty)$?",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ladder-1 brackets with the L=1 weights; Fv[i, m] = F_i(θ1 + m h) *)\npoles1 = Range[Λ[[3]], Λ[[1]]]; wgt1[n_] := 1/Product[(m - n) hN, {m, DeleteCases[poles1, n]}];\nth1 = thN[[1]];\ndetN1[B_, Fv_] := Det[Table[Sum[With[{xx = th1 - n hN}, wgt1[n] {-QU[B, ij[[2]], xx] Fv[ij[[1]], -n], QU[B, ij[[2]], xx] Fv[ij[[1]], -n + 1], QU[B, ij[[2]], xx - hN] Fv[ij[[1]], -n]}], {n, poles1}], {ij, {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}}}]];\nbr1[f_] := Sum[wgt1[n] f[th1 - n hN], {n, poles1}];\nsu2det1[B_, y_] := Module[{E1 = Function[x, N[y^(-(x - th1)/hN), prec]]}, Det[Table[{-br1[Function[x, QU[B, j, x] E1[x]]], br1[Function[x, QU[B, j, x - hN] E1[x]]]}, {j, {3, 2}}]]];\nminor1[B_] := QU[B, 2, th1 - 2 hN] QU[B, 3, th1 - 3 hN] - QU[B, 3, th1 - 2 hN] QU[B, 2, th1 - 3 hN];\npsiQ1[B_] := minor1[B] QU[B, 3, th1 - hN];\n(* bra data: L=1 w-vacuum direct Q's at site 1 (cell 25), and the L=2 w-vacuum Q's *)\nFw1 = Function[{i, m}, QDv1[i, th1 + m hN]]; Fw2 = Function[{i, m}, QD[\"vac\", i, th1 + m hN]];\ny1N = -6/5;\nL1form[B_, Fv_] := detN1[B, Fv] su2det1[B, y1N]/(psiQ1[B] minor1[B]);\n(* (a) span test: least-squares fit to sum_nu phi_nu psi_nu over the 64 states *)\nAmat = Table[psiAB[B], {B, nS}];\nspanFit[vals_] := Module[{φ = LeastSquares[Amat, vals]}, {φ, Norm[Amat . φ - vals]/Norm[vals]}];\n{φfit1, res1} = spanFit[Table[L1form[B, Fw1], {B, nS}]];\n{φfit2, res2} = spanFit[Table[L1form[B, Fw2], {B, nS}]];\n(* the exact 12-state sum is in the span of the 16 functions psi x {1, λ2}; control that the fit machinery works: *)\nAmat16 = Table[Join[psiAB[B], λ2B[[B]] psiAB[B]], {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"16 functions psi x {1,λ2} independent on 64 states (min sv / max sv)\"] = With[{s = SingularValueList[N[Amat16, 30]]}, Last[s]/First[s]];\n(* (b) rotation test of the fitted vectors *)\nchecks[\"(a) L=1 det formula (L=1 vac Q's) in span of 8 psi: rel residual\"] = res1;\nchecks[\"(a) L=1 det formula (L=2 vac Q's) in span of 8 psi: rel residual\"] = res2;\nchecks[\"(b) fitted phi (L=1 vac Q's) rotation? (2nd/1st sv)\"] = rank1dev[Xc[φfit1]];\nchecks[\"(b) fitted phi (L=2 vac Q's) rotation? (2nd/1st sv)\"] = rank1dev[Xc[φfit2]];\nStringRiffle[ToString[N[#, 3]] & /@ {checks[\"16 functions psi x {1,λ2} independent on 64 states (min sv / max sv)\"], res1, res2, checks[\"(b) fitted phi (L=1 vac Q's) rotation? (2nd/1st sv)\"], checks[\"(b) fitted phi (L=2 vac Q's) rotation? (2nd/1st sv)\"]}, \" | \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"368062\" data-output-id=\"27\" data-out-n=\"336\" data-sub-idx=\"25\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"67\" data-sub-start=\"25\" data-sub-end=\"25\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[336]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7MC4wMDAwMjA0IHwgMC4xMTIgfCAwLjExMyB8IDAuMTk0IHwgMC4xNzh9\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0000204 | 0.112 | 0.113 | 0.194 | 0.178</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[336]= \\text{0.0000204 | 0.112 | 0.113 | 0.194 | 0.178}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "bbdd79a8-0cd8-4a58-8119-2db129f8387d"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (c) the matching rotation g = M(w) M(y1, ∞): covector Ω_w ρ((y1 - G(z)^T)^-1) in the companion frame, as in Rotation-e8-SoV §10 *)\nρG[m_] := MatrixExp[Sum[MatrixLog[m][[i, k]] N[Ee[i, k], prec], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]];\nGzN = N[Gc[zN], prec];\nφtar = Ωc[wN] . ρG[Inverse[y1N IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]]];\nctar = φtar . Inverse[N[xL1, prec]];\nchecks[\"(c) target covector is a rotation (2nd/1st sv)\"] = rank1dev[Xc[ctar]];\n(* compare: fitted phi vs ctar (K = 1 hypothesis) and vs ctar.Kvac (group 1), up to one overall scale *)\ncmpScale[u_, v_] := Module[{s = (u . v)/(v . v)}, {s, Norm[u - s v]/Norm[u]}];\ncmp = {\"phi(L=1 vac) vs ctar\" -> cmpScale[φfit1, ctar], \"phi(L=1 vac) vs ctar.Kvac\" -> cmpScale[φfit1, ctar . Kvac], \"phi(L=2 vac) vs ctar\" -> cmpScale[φfit2, ctar], \"phi(L=2 vac) vs ctar.Kvac\" -> cmpScale[φfit2, ctar . Kvac]};\n(* and the exact overlap of φtar ⊗ e1 (12-state sum, includes the λ2 group) vs the L=1 formula on ladder 1 *)\nexactTar = Table[exactOvl[ctar, B], {B, nS}];\ncmpFull = {\"exact overlap vs L=1 formula (L=1 vac)\" -> cmpScale[exactTar, Table[L1form[B, Fw1], {B, nS}]], \"exact overlap vs L=1 formula (L=2 vac)\" -> cmpScale[exactTar, Table[L1form[B, Fw2], {B, nS}]]};\nStringRiffle[{N[checks[\"(c) target covector is a rotation (2nd/1st sv)\"], 3], StringReplace[ToString[N[cmp, 4], InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"], StringReplace[ToString[N[cmpFull, 4], InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]}, \" || \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
