   "value": "(* symbolic 2-plane model of the ladder-1 Q-values and symbolic bra data F[i, m]; L=1 weights wgt1 (h = 1/2, rational) *)\n(* NB: uSym/wSym, not uS: uS is the list of interpolation points used by tPoly (cell 3) *)\nuSym = {u1, u2, u3}; wSym = {w1, w2, w3};\nvS[m_] := Switch[m, -3, uSym, -2, wSym, -1, α uSym + β wSym, 0, λ1 (α uSym + β wSym)];\nbrS[j_, μ_] := Sum[μ[m] vS[m][[j]], {m, -3, 0}];\n(* L=1-type columns; pole n -> x = θ1 - n h, n = 0,1,2: col1 = -Q(x)F(x), col2 = Q(x)F(x+h), col3 = Q(x-h)F(x) *)\ncolμ[1][i_] := Function[m, If[-2 <= m <= 0, -wgt1[-m] F[i, m], 0]];\ncolμ[2][i_] := Function[m, If[-2 <= m <= 0, wgt1[-m] F[i, m + 1], 0]];\ncolμ[3][i_] := Function[m, If[-3 <= m <= -1, wgt1[-m - 1] F[i, m + 1], 0]];\ndet3S[rows_] := Det[Table[brS[ij[[2]], colμ[c][ij[[1]]]], {ij, rows}, {c, 3}]];\nrowsL1 = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}};\nnumS = Expand[det3S[rowsL1]];\npsiQS = Expand[(w2 u3 - w3 u2) (α u3 + β w3)];\n(* numeric sanity of the symbolic model: det3S with F -> L=1 vac Q's and (u,w,α,β,λ1) of state B reproduces detN1 *)\nFvars = Flatten[Table[F[i, m], {i, 2}, {m, -2, 1}]];\nmodelSubs[B_] := Join[Thread[uSym -> vv[B, 1, -3]], Thread[wSym -> vv[B, 1, -2]], subsB[B], Table[F[i, m] -> Fw1[i, m], {i, 2}, {m, -2, 1}] // Flatten];\nchecks[\"symbolic 3x3 model = detN1 (states 1, 17, 40)\"] = Max[Table[Abs[(numS /. modelSubs[B])/detN1[B, Fw1] - 1], {B, {1, 17, 40}}]];\n(* locality: f = coefficient of w2 u3^2 over α; residual must vanish identically in u, w, α, β, λ1 *)\nfS = Cancel[Coefficient[numS, w2 u3^2]/α];\nresidS = Expand[numS - fS psiQS];\nlocEqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[CoefficientList[residS, {u1, u2, u3, w1, w2, w3, α, β, λ1}]]], 0];\nlocEqs = Union[Numerator[Together[#]] & /@ locEqs];\nlocSol = Solve[locEqs == 0, Fvars];\n{N[checks[\"symbolic 3x3 model = detN1 (states 1, 17, 40)\"], 3], Length[locEqs], Length[locSol], locSol}",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* symbolic 2-plane model of the ladder-1 Q-values and symbolic bra data F[i, m]; L=1 weights wgt1 (h = 1/2, rational) *)\n(* NB: uSym/wSym, not uS: uS is the list of interpolation points used by tPoly (cell 3); clobbering it crashed the kernel on 2026-10-09 *)\nuSym = {u1, u2, u3}; wSym = {w1, w2, w3};\nvS[m_] := Switch[m, -3, uSym, -2, wSym, -1, α uSym + β wSym, 0, λ1 (α uSym + β wSym)];\nbrS[j_, μ_] := Sum[μ[m] vS[m][[j]], {m, -3, 0}];\n(* L=1-type columns; pole n -> x = θ1 - n h, n = 0,1,2: col1 = -Q(x)F(x), col2 = Q(x)F(x+h), col3 = Q(x-h)F(x) *)\ncolμ[1][i_] := Function[m, If[-2 <= m <= 0, -wgt1[-m] F[i, m], 0]];\ncolμ[2][i_] := Function[m, If[-2 <= m <= 0, wgt1[-m] F[i, m + 1], 0]];\ncolμ[3][i_] := Function[m, If[-3 <= m <= -1, wgt1[-m - 1] F[i, m + 1], 0]];\ndet3S[rows_] := Det[Table[brS[ij[[2]], colμ[c][ij[[1]]]], {ij, rows}, {c, 3}]];\nrowsL1 = {{1, 3}, {1, 2}, {2, 3}};\nnumS = Expand[det3S[rowsL1]];\npsiQS = Expand[(w2 u3 - w3 u2) (α u3 + β w3)];\n(* numeric sanity of the symbolic model: det3S with F -> L=1 vac Q's and (u,w,α,β,λ1) of state B reproduces detN1 *)\nFvars = Flatten[Table[F[i, m], {i, 2}, {m, -2, 1}]];\nmodelSubs[B_] := Join[Thread[uSym -> vv[B, 1, -3]], Thread[wSym -> vv[B, 1, -2]], subsB[B], Table[F[i, m] -> Fw1[i, m], {i, 2}, {m, -2, 1}] // Flatten];\nchecks[\"symbolic 3x3 model = detN1 (states 1, 17, 40)\"] = Max[Table[Abs[(numS /. modelSubs[B])/detN1[B, Fw1] - 1], {B, {1, 17, 40}}]];\n(* locality: f = coefficient of w2 u3^2 over α; residual must vanish identically in u, w, α, β, λ1 *)\nfS = Cancel[Coefficient[numS, w2 u3^2]/α];\nresidS = Expand[numS - fS psiQS];\nlocEqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[CoefficientList[residS, {u1, u2, u3, w1, w2, w3, α, β, λ1}]]], 0];\nlocEqs = Union[Numerator[Together[#]] & /@ locEqs];\nlocSol = Solve[locEqs == 0, Fvars];\n{N[checks[\"symbolic 3x3 model = detN1 (states 1, 17, 40)\"], 3], Length[locEqs], Length[locSol], locSol}",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
