   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* main local branch, gauge-fixed by F2 -> F2 - (F2(-2)/F1(-2)) F1 (row 3 -> row 3 + c row 1 leaves the det invariant): F2 supported on {0, 1} *)\nfLoc = Expand[fS /. {F[2, -2] -> 0, F[2, -1] -> 0}];\nchecks[\"local branch: residual vanishes identically\"] = (Expand[residS /. {F[2, -2] -> 0, F[2, -1] -> 0}] === 0);\n(* coefficient vector in the psi-basis {1, β, -α, λ1, λ1 β, λ1^2 β, -λ1 α, -λ1^2 α}; check nothing is left over *)\nφofF = {fLoc /. {α -> 0, β -> 0, λ1 -> 0}, Coefficient[fLoc /. λ1 -> 0, β], -Coefficient[fLoc /. λ1 -> 0, α], Coefficient[fLoc, λ1] /. {α -> 0, β -> 0}, Coefficient[Coefficient[fLoc, λ1], β], Coefficient[Coefficient[fLoc, λ1, 2], β], -Coefficient[Coefficient[fLoc, λ1], α], -Coefficient[Coefficient[fLoc, λ1, 2], α]};\nchecks[\"local f is exactly in the span of the 8 psi\"] = (Expand[fLoc - φofF . psiSym] === 0);\nFloc = {F[1, -2], F[1, -1], F[1, 0], F[1, 1], F[2, 0], F[2, 1]};\n(* image dimension of F -> φ (generic Jacobian rank) *)\nchecks[\"local family: image dimension (Jacobian rank)\"] = MatrixRank[D[φofF, {Floc}] /. Thread[Floc -> RandomInteger[{2, 30}, 6]]];\n(* resolvent member: F1 = y^(-m), F2 = y^(-m) on {-2,-1}, 0 on {0,1}  ==  gauge  F2 = -y^(-m) on {0,1}; compare with the rotation x0.ρ((y - G^T)^-1) *)\nφres[y_] := φofF /. {F[1, m_] :> y^(-m), F[2, m_] :> -y^(-m)};\ncres[y_] := (uv[1] . ρG[Inverse[y IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]]]) . Inverse[N[xL1, prec]];\nchecks[\"resolvent det N_∞ on ladder 1 = rotation x0.ρ((y-G^T)^-1) ⊗ e1 (rel dev, 3 y's)\"] = Max[Table[Last[cmpScale[N[φres[y], prec], cres[y]]], {y, {-6/5, 3, 7/4}}]];\nchecks[\"resolvent det N_∞ on ladder 1 is a rotation (2nd/1st sv)\"] = Max[Table[rank1dev[Xc[N[φres[y], prec]]], {y, {-6/5, 3, 7/4}}]];\nStringRiffle[{checks[\"local branch: residual vanishes identically\"], checks[\"local f is exactly in the span of the 8 psi\"], checks[\"local family: image dimension (Jacobian rank)\"], N[checks[\"resolvent det N_∞ on ladder 1 = rotation x0.ρ((y-G^T)^-1) ⊗ e1 (rel dev, 3 y's)\"], 3], N[checks[\"resolvent det N_∞ on ladder 1 is a rotation (2nd/1st sv)\"], 3]}, \" | \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"983836\" data-output-id=\"28\" data-out-n=\"345\" data-sub-idx=\"14\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"71\" data-sub-start=\"14\" data-sub-end=\"14\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[345]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7VHJ1ZSB8IFRydWUgfCA0IHwgMC45OTUgfCAwLjE2N30=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">True | True | 4 | 0.995 | 0.167</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[345]= \\text{True | True | 4 | 0.995 | 0.167}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
