  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* numeric cross-check fit of a target φ (8-vector, exact scale) into the local family: F2 = (p, q) enters linearly, so for fixed F1 it is least squares; minimize over F1 in P^3 (random chart) from random starts. Warnings (lstol etc.) are harmless; only a non-numeric result is discarded. *)\nφF1lin[F1_] := Module[{v0, vp, vq}, v0 = φofF /. Thread[Floc -> Join[F1, {0, 0}]]; vp = (φofF /. Thread[Floc -> Join[F1, {1, 0}]]) - v0; vq = (φofF /. Thread[Floc -> Join[F1, {0, 1}]]) - v0; {v0, vp, vq}];\nresF1[F1_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &), tgt_] := Module[{v0, vp, vq, M, pq}, {v0, vp, vq} = φF1lin[F1]; M = Transpose[{vp, vq}]; pq = LeastSquares[M, tgt - v0]; Norm[M . pq + v0 - tgt]/Norm[tgt]];\nfitLocal[tgt_, nStart_: 8] := Module[{best = Infinity, chart, start, r}, SeedRandom[3];\n  Do[chart = RandomInteger[{1, 4}]; start = RandomReal[{-2, 2}, 3, WorkingPrecision -> 40];\n    r = Quiet[FindMinimum[resF1[Insert[{x1, x2, x3}, 1, chart], tgt], Transpose[{{x1, x2, x3}, start}], WorkingPrecision -> 40, AccuracyGoal -> 20, PrecisionGoal -> 20, MaxIterations -> 300]];\n    If[ListQ[r] && NumericQ[r[[1]]], best = Min[best, r[[1]]]], {nStart}]; best];\ntargets = {\"group 1: c.Kvac\" -> ctar . Kvac, \"group 2: c.K20\" -> ctar . K20, \"group 1: cL1.Kvac\" -> cL1 . Kvac, \"group 2: cL1.K20\" -> cL1 . K20, \"resolvent-rotation group 1 (cres.Kvac)\" -> cres[7/4] . Kvac, \"local-family member (control, should fit)\" -> (φofF /. Thread[Floc -> {1, 2/3, -1/2, 3/7, 1/5, -2/9}])};\nchecks[\"targets imaginary parts negligible\"] = Max[Abs[Im[N[targets[[All, 2]], 40]]]];\nfitTab = Table[t[[1]] -> fitLocal[Re[N[t[[2]], 40]]], {t, targets}];\nchecks[\"local-family fits (rel residuals, numeric upper bounds)\"] = N[fitTab, 3];\nStringReplace[ToString[{N[checks[\"targets imaginary parts negligible\"], 2], N[fitTab, 3]}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
