  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* locality with three independent bra functions F1 (row (1,3)), F2 (row (1,2) -> relabel as F[3,m]), F2 (row (2,3)): is the local family larger? *)\nrowsGen = {{1, 3}, {3, 2}, {2, 3}};\nnumG = Expand[det3S[rowsGen]];\nfG = Cancel[Coefficient[numG, w2 u3^2]/α];\nresidG = Expand[numG - fG psiQS];\nlocEqsG = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[CoefficientList[residG, {u1, u2, u3, w1, w2, w3, α, β, λ1}]]], 0];\nlocEqsG = Union[Numerator[Together[#]] & /@ locEqsG];\nFvarsG = Flatten[Table[F[i, m], {i, 3}, {m, -2, 1}]];\nlocSolG = TimeConstrained[Solve[locEqsG == 0, FvarsG], 300, $Failed];\n(* dimension of each solution component: count free F's; and the image dimension of f on it *)\ncompInfo = If[locSolG === $Failed, $Failed, Table[Module[{fr = Complement[FvarsG, First /@ sol], fsub = Expand[fG /. sol], φG},\n    φG = {fsub /. {α -> 0, β -> 0, λ1 -> 0}, Coefficient[fsub /. λ1 -> 0, β], -Coefficient[fsub /. λ1 -> 0, α], Coefficient[fsub, λ1] /. {α -> 0, β -> 0}, Coefficient[Coefficient[fsub, λ1], β], Coefficient[Coefficient[fsub, λ1, 2], β], -Coefficient[Coefficient[fsub, λ1], α], -Coefficient[Coefficient[fsub, λ1, 2], α]};\n    {sol, Length[fr], If[Expand[fsub - φG . psiSym] === 0, MatrixRank[D[φG, {fr}] /. Thread[fr -> RandomInteger[{2, 30}, Length[fr]]]], \"not in span\"]}], {sol, locSolG}]];\nStringReplace[ToString[{Length[locEqsG], If[locSolG === $Failed, \"Solve timed out\", Length[locSolG]], compInfo}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
