  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* is a group vector a SUM of two local 3x3 determinants? F2-data (p,q,p',q') enter linearly -> least squares for fixed (F1, F1'); minimize over the two F1's (charts with one coordinate = 1) from random starts. (resTwo, not res2: res2 is the span-fit residual of the control cell.) *)\nresTwo[F1a_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &), F1b_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &), tgt_] := Module[{a, b, M, pq}, a = φF1lin[F1a]; b = φF1lin[F1b]; M = Transpose[{a[[2]], a[[3]], b[[2]], b[[3]]}]; pq = LeastSquares[M, tgt - a[[1]] - b[[1]]]; Norm[M . pq + a[[1]] + b[[1]] - tgt]/Norm[tgt]];\nfit2Local[tgt_, nStart_: 10] := Module[{best = Infinity, ca, cb, st, r, vars = {x1, x2, x3, y1, y2, y3}}, SeedRandom[9];\n  Do[{ca, cb} = RandomInteger[{1, 4}, 2]; st = RandomReal[{-2, 2}, 6, WorkingPrecision -> 40];\n    r = Quiet[FindMinimum[resTwo[Insert[{x1, x2, x3}, 1, ca], Insert[{y1, y2, y3}, 1, cb], tgt], Transpose[{vars, st}], WorkingPrecision -> 40, AccuracyGoal -> 20, PrecisionGoal -> 20, MaxIterations -> 400]];\n    If[ListQ[r] && NumericQ[r[[1]]], best = Min[best, r[[1]]]], {nStart}]; best];\ncr1 = rotFromAB @@ abList[[1]];\ntargets2 = {\"group 1: ctar.Kvac\" -> ctar . Kvac, \"group 2: ctar.K20\" -> ctar . K20, \"group 1: cr1.Kvac\" -> cr1 . Kvac, \"group 2: cr1.K20\" -> cr1 . K20, \"random 8-vector\" -> RandomInteger[{-9, 9}, 8], \"control: sum of two members\" -> (φofF /. Thread[Floc -> {1, 2/3, -1/2, 3/7, 1/5, -2/9}]) + (φofF /. Thread[Floc -> {2, -1/3, 1/4, 5/7, -3/5, 1/9}])};\nfit2Tab = Table[t[[1]] -> fit2Local[Re[N[t[[2]], 40]]], {t, targets2}];\nchecks[\"sum-of-two local dets fits (rel residuals, numeric upper bounds)\"] = N[fit2Tab, 3];\nStringReplace[ToString[N[fit2Tab, 3], InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
