  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## 9. Two different rotations on the two sites (2026-10-09)\nTarget: $\\Phi=x_0\\rho(g_1)\\otimes x_0\\rho(g_2)$ with $g_s\\leftrightarrow(w_s,y_s)$. Step 1: the two vacua $\\Omega_{w_1}\\otimes\\Omega_{w_2}$ ($w_1=w$, $w_2=w'$). Ansatz: the global $\\det_6$ (brackets = genuine contour integrals over all six poles, insertions $1$ and $e^{2\\pi ix/h}$) with **ladder-dependent bra data**: on the ladder-$s$ poles, $F$ = vacuum Q's of twist $w_s$ (either the L=2 chain's $w_s$-vacuum Q's or the one-site vacuum Q's at $\\theta_s$). Also the per-ladder $\\det_6$ of §5.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* second twist w' on site 2 *)\nwP = {7/4, -2/5, 9/7}; numZW2 = Join[Thread[zs -> zN], Thread[ws -> wP]];\n(* L=2 w'-vacuum: eigen-bra Ω_{w'}⊗Ω_{w'} of t(G'_{w'}), its eigenvalues, and its direct Q's (as in cell 6) *)\nGPzw2 = Simplify[Paux . Gc[ws] . Inverse[Paux]] /. numZW2;\nrOm2 = {r1 -> (w[1] - z[1])/(w[1] - z[2]), r2 -> ((w[1] - z[1]) (-w[2] + z[1]) (z[2] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (w[2] - z[3])), r3 -> ((w[1] - z[2]) (-w[2] + z[2]) (z[1] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (-w[2] + z[3]))} /. numZW2;\nΩ1P = First[{UnitVector[d1, 1]} . MatrixExp[(r1 /. rOm2) Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[(r2 /. rOm2) Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[(r3 /. rOm2) Ee[2, 3]]];\nΩ2P = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1P, Ω1P]];\ntW2 = Table[tPoly[GPzw2, a], {a, 3}];\nkOm2 = Ordering[Abs[Ω2P], -1][[1]];\ntauVac2 = Table[Expand[(Ω2P . tW2[[a]])[[kOm2]]/Ω2P[[kOm2]]], {a, 3}];\nchecks[\"Ω_{w'}⊗Ω_{w'} eigen-bra of t(G'_{w'})\"] = And @@ Table[Union[Flatten[Expand[Ω2P . tW2[[a]] - tauVac2[[a]] Ω2P]]] === {0}, {a, 3}];\nqdVac2 = Table[solveQ[opDir, N[tauVac2, prec], wP[[i]], -1], {i, 3}];\nchecks[\"w'-vacuum direct q's found, degrees (0,2,4)\"] = FreeQ[qdVac2, {}] && Exponent[qdVac2, X] === {0, 2, 4};\nQD2vac[i_, x_] := QD2vac[i, x] = N[wP[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (qdVac2[[i]] /. X -> x);\nFvac2 = Function[{i, x}, QD2vac[i, x]];\n(* one-site vacuum Q's of twist w' at site 2 (θ2), as QDv1 at site 1 (cell 25) *)\nnu2[n_][x_] := x - thN[[2]] + hN Λ[[n]];\ntVac2s = {Sum[wP[[j]] nu2[j][u], {j, 3}], Sum[wP[[i]] wP[[j]] nu2[i][u] nu2[j][u - hN], {i, 3}, {j, i + 1, 3}], (Times @@ wP) nu2[1][u] nu2[2][u - hN] nu2[3][u - 2 hN]};\nopDir2[tt_, Q_, x_] := nu2[1][x] nu2[1][x + hN] nu2[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x - hN] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) nu2[1][x + hN] nu2[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + hN) nu2[1][x + 2 hN] Q[x + hN] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2 hN) Q[x + 2 hN];\nqdVac1P = Table[solveQ[opDir2, tVac2s, wP[[i]], -1], {i, 3}];\nchecks[\"one-site w'-vacuum q's at site 2, degrees (0,1,2)\"] = FreeQ[qdVac1P, {}] && Exponent[qdVac1P, X] === {0, 1, 2};\nQDv2[i_, x_] := N[wP[[i]]^(-x/hN), prec] (qdVac1P[[i]] /. X -> x);\n(* targets: Ω_w ⊗ Ω_{w'} and (sanity) Ω_{w'} ⊗ Ω_{w'} *)\nT12 = Table[(Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ωc[wN], Ωc[wP]]] . ketC[[B]])/(x0C . ketC[[B]]), {B, nS}];\nT22 = Table[(Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ωc[wP], Ωc[wP]]] . ketC[[B]])/(x0C . ketC[[B]]), {B, nS}];\nchecks[\"sanity: Ω_{w'}⊗Ω_{w'} ∝ det6[F_vac,w']/Psi_Q\"] = constQ[Table[T22[[B]]/(det6[B, Fvac2]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]];\n(* ladder-dependent bra data *)\nFL2L2 = Function[{i, x}, If[ladOf[x] == 1, QD[\"vac\", i, x], QD2vac[i, x]]];\nFL1L1 = Function[{i, x}, If[ladOf[x] == 1, QDv1[i, x], QDv2[i, x]]];\nFL2L1 = Function[{i, x}, If[ladOf[x] == 1, QD[\"vac\", i, x], QDv2[i, x]]];\nFL1L2 = Function[{i, x}, If[ladOf[x] == 1, QDv1[i, x], QD2vac[i, x]]];\nres12 = {\n  \"full det6, ladder1 = L2 vac(w), ladder2 = L2 vac(w')\" -> constQ[Table[T12[[B]]/(det6[B, FL2L2]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]],\n  \"full det6, one-site vac Q's per ladder\" -> constQ[Table[T12[[B]]/(det6[B, FL1L1]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]],\n  \"full det6, L2 vac(w) | one-site(w')\" -> constQ[Table[T12[[B]]/(det6[B, FL2L1]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]],\n  \"full det6, one-site(w) | L2 vac(w')\" -> constQ[Table[T12[[B]]/(det6[B, FL1L2]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]],\n  \"per-ladder det6L, {L2 vac(w), L2 vac(w')}\" -> constQ[Table[T12[[B]]/(det6L[B, {Fvac, Fvac2}]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]],\n  \"per-ladder det6L, {one-site(w), one-site(w')}\" -> constQ[Table[T12[[B]]/(det6L[B, {Fv1, Function[{i, x}, QDv2[i, x]]}]/psiQ[B]), {B, nS}]]};\nchecks[\"Ω_w⊗Ω_{w'} ansatz residuals\"] = N[res12, 3];\nStringReplace[ToString[{checks[\"Ω_{w'}⊗Ω_{w'} eigen-bra of t(G'_{w'})\"], checks[\"w'-vacuum direct q's found, degrees (0,2,4)\"], checks[\"one-site w'-vacuum q's at site 2, degrees (0,1,2)\"], N[checks[\"sanity: Ω_{w'}⊗Ω_{w'} ∝ det6[F_vac,w']/Psi_Q\"], 3], N[res12, 3]}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"368062\" data-output-id=\"20\" data-out-n=\"249\" data-sub-idx=\"33\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"81\" data-sub-start=\"39\" data-sub-end=\"39\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[249]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"14\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1813em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">True, True, True, 0</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">48.62457176099033, </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ull det6, ladder1 = L2 vac(w), ladder2 = L2 vac(w’)</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"> </span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">-&gt; 24.9278524844610681647</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">3., </span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9313em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">f</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">¨</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">ull det6, one-site vac Q’s per ladder</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top