  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Sum over SoV integrals with a factorized bra wavefunction?** Write $\\langle\\Phi|\\Psi_B\\rangle/\\langle x_0|\\Psi_B\\rangle=\\sum_xM_\\Phi(x)\\,\\psi_B(x)$ with $M_\\Phi(x)=c_x N_x$ (SoV coefficients times the state-independent normalizations, cell 20). In FSoV language $M_\\Phi(x)=\\mu_x\\Phi(x)$ with the SoV measure $\\mu_x$ (which couples the two ladders) and the bra wavefunction $\\Phi(x)$. Conjecture for a product bra: $\\Phi_{ab}(x)=\\Phi^1_a(x_1)\\Phi^2_b(x_2)$. Measure-free test: $M_{ww'}(x)M_{w'w}(x)=M_{ww}(x)M_{w'w'}(x)$ for all 64 $x$; equivalently the ratio $M_{ww'}(x)/M_{ww}(x)$ depends on $x_2$ only.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* SoV coefficients (times N_x) of the four product vacua Ω_a ⊗ Ω_b, arranged as 8x8 matrices (site-1 triple, site-2 triple) in trip order *)\ntripPos[t_] := First[FirstPosition[trip, t]];\nMmat[Φ_] := Module[{c = LinearSolve[Transpose[vecB], N[Φ, prec]] Nm, M = ConstantArray[0, {8, 8}]}, Do[M[[tripPos[lab[m][[1]]], tripPos[lab[m][[2]]]]] = c[[m]], {m, 64}]; M];\nΩab[a_, b_] := Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ωc[a], Ωc[b]]];\n{Mww, Mwp, Mpw, Mpp} = Mmat /@ {Ωab[wN, wN], Ωab[wN, wP], Ωab[wP, wN], Ωab[wP, wP]};\n(* sanity: the M's reproduce the overlaps *)\nchecks[\"M(Ω_w⊗Ω_w') reproduces the overlap (max rel dev)\"] = Max[Table[Abs[Sum[Mwp[[i, j]] psi1[B, trip[[i]]] psiSite[B, 2, trip[[j]], {1, 2}, 1]/psiSite[B, 2, {-3, -2, -1}, {1, 2}, 1], {i, 8}, {j, 8}]/T12[[B]] - 1], {B, nS}]];\n(* factorization test *)\nfacDev = Max[Abs[Flatten[Mwp Mpw - Mww Mpp]]]/Max[Abs[Flatten[Mww Mpp]]];\nchecks[\"factorized bra wavefunction: M_ww' M_w'w = M_ww M_w'w' (rel dev)\"] = facDev;\n(* ratio form: M_ww'/M_ww should be a function of x2 only *)\nratioM = Mwp/Mww;\nchecks[\"M_ww'/M_ww independent of the site-1 triple (max rel spread over columns)\"] = Max[Table[Max[Abs[ratioM[[All, j]]/ratioM[[1, j]] - 1]], {j, 8}]];\n(* supports *)\nsupports = {Count[Flatten[Abs[Mww]], _?(# > 10^-30 &)], Count[Flatten[Abs[Mwp]], _?(# > 10^-30 &)]};\nStringReplace[ToString[{N[checks[\"M(Ω_w⊗Ω_w') reproduces the overlap (max rel dev)\"], 3], N[facDev, 3], N[checks[\"M_ww'/M_ww independent of the site-1 triple (max rel spread over columns)\"], 3], supports, N[res12[[5 ;; 6]], 3]}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
