  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Exp. 2: localization of T_λ(θ1-2h) on the twisted vacuum Ω_w⊗Ω_w (diagonal frame; T2n, T1n, lams from cell 14) *)\nΩ2d = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1, Ω1]];\nlocΩ = Table[Module[{lhs = Ω2d . T2n[l], rhs = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1 . T1n[l], Ω1]], f}, f = Simplify[(lhs . rhs)/(rhs . rhs)]; {l, f, N[Norm[N[lhs - f rhs, 30]]/Norm[N[lhs, 30]], 3]}], {l, lams}];\n(* rotations in the linear span of the localizing insertions: v1 = a.(c0 + c1 T11 + c2 T21), a = Ω1 or x01; rotation <=> all 2x2 minors of X vanish; exact solve *)\nXdiag[v_] := Xmat[v . Pph1];\nrotSolve[a_] := Module[{v1, X, eqs}, v1 = a . (c0 IdentityMatrix[d1] + c1 T1n[{1, 1}] + c2 T1n[{2, 1}]); X = Xdiag[v1]; eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[X, 2]]], 0]; Solve[eqs == 0, {c0, c1, c2}]];\nsolΩ = rotSolve[Ω1]; solx0 = rotSolve[x01];\n(* dimension check: are Ω1, Ω1T11, Ω1T21 independent? *)\nchecks[\"span{Ω1, Ω1 T11, Ω1 T21} dimension\"] = MatrixRank[{Ω1, Ω1 . T1n[{1, 1}], Ω1 . T1n[{2, 1}]}];\nStringReplace[ToString[{locΩ, checks[\"span{Ω1, Ω1 T11, Ω1 T21} dimension\"], solΩ, solx0}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
