  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Exp. 1b: structure of the rank-2 covector Φ_y = <Ω|K_y (companion frame): singular values with no tolerance cut, is Ωc[w] in the site-2 column space, what is the second site-2 direction *)\nsvdFull[φ_] := SingularValueDecomposition[N[Partition[φ, d1], 30]];\nprojRes[v_, basis_] := Module[{A = Transpose[basis], c}, c = LeastSquares[A, v]; Norm[A . c - v]/Norm[v]];\nstruct[y_] := Module[{φ = covOf[fL1[y]], u, s, v, cols, Ωn, inΩ, w2, rot2}, {u, s, v} = svdFull[φ]; cols = Conjugate[Transpose[v]][[1 ;; 2]]; (* site-2 column space *)\n   Ωn = N[Ωc[wN], 30]; inΩ = projRes[Ωn, cols];\n   (* second direction: component of the column space orthogonal to Ωc *)\n   w2 = Orthogonalize[Join[{Ωn}, cols]][[2]]; rot2 = rank1dev[Xmat[w2]];\n   {y, N[Diagonal[s][[1 ;; 3]]/s[[1, 1]], 3], N[inΩ, 3], N[rot2, 3], w2}];\nst = Table[struct[y], {y, {-6/5, 3}}];\nchecks[\"Φ_y: Ω_w in site-2 column space (proj residual, 2 y's)\"] = Max[st[[All, 3]]];\nchecks[\"Φ_y: second site-2 direction y-independent (rel dev)\"] = Norm[st[[1, 5]] - (st[[1, 5]] . Conjugate[st[[2, 5]]]) st[[2, 5]]]/Norm[st[[1, 5]]];\n(* the same for <Ω|T10 and <Ω|T20 at θ1-2h (diag frame -> companion by .Pph2) *)\nPph2 = KroneckerProduct[Pph1, Pph1];\nφT[l_, v_] := (Ω2d . T2[l, v]) . Pph2;\nsvT[l_, v_] := With[{s = SingularValueList[N[Partition[φT[l, v], d1], 30], Tolerance -> 0]}, N[s[[2 ;; 3]]/s[[1]], 3]];\nexp1b = {Table[{l, svT[l, v0]}, {l, lams}], Table[{l, N[projRes[N[Ωc[wN], 30], Conjugate[Transpose[svdFull[φT[l, v0]][[3]]]][[1 ;; 2]]], 3]}, {l, {{1, 0}, {2, 0}}}]};\nStringReplace[ToString[{st[[All, 1 ;; 4]], N[checks[\"Φ_y: Ω_w in site-2 column space (proj residual, 2 y's)\"], 3], N[checks[\"Φ_y: second site-2 direction y-independent (rel dev)\"], 3], exp1b}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
