  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Exp. 3: rank scan of <Ω|T_λ(v) over shapes and lattice points v = θ1 + m h (diag frame), and of <Ω|t_a(v) *)\nrankOf[φ_] := Length[Select[SingularValueList[N[Partition[φ, d1], 30], Tolerance -> 10^-20], # > 10^-20 &]];\nrankTab = Table[{l, m, rankOf[Ω2d . T2[l, thN[[1]] + m hN]]}, {l, lams}, {m, -3, 1}];\nrankTabT = Table[{a, m, rankOf[Ω2d . tZv[a, thN[[1]] + m hN]]}, {a, 3}, {m, -3, 1}];\n(* joint localization: site-1 localizing T11(θ1-2h) times site-2 localizing A = t2(θ2+h), B = t2(θ2+h) t1(θ2-h) (handoff 2026-10-01) *)\nA2 = tZv[2, thN[[2]] + hN]; B2 = tZv[2, thN[[2]] + hN] . tZv[1, thN[[2]] - hN];\nchecks[\"site-2 localizers on Ω: rank of <Ω|A2, <Ω|B2\"] = {rankOf[Ω2d . A2], rankOf[Ω2d . B2]};\nchecks[\"joint: rank of <Ω|T11 A2, <Ω|T11 B2, <Ω|T21 A2, <Ω|T21 B2\"] = {rankOf[Ω2d . T2n[{1, 1}] . A2], rankOf[Ω2d . T2n[{1, 1}] . B2], rankOf[Ω2d . T2n[{2, 1}] . A2], rankOf[Ω2d . T2n[{2, 1}] . B2]};\n(* are the site-2 factors Ω1 A2^(1), Ω1 B2^(1) rotations? one-site transfer matrices at θ2 for site 2 *)\nL1m2[i_, j_][v_] := KroneckerDelta[i, j] (v - thN[[2]]) IdentityMatrix[d1] + hN Ee[i, j];\nqm12[I_, J_][v_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[zN[[J[[k]]]] L1m2[σ[[k]], J[[k]]][v - (k - 1) hN], {k, Length[J]}], {σ, Permutations[I]}];\nt1s2[a_, v_] := Sum[qm12[I, I][v], {I, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\nA21 = t1s2[2, thN[[2]] + hN]; B21 = t1s2[2, thN[[2]] + hN] . t1s2[1, thN[[2]] - hN];\nlocS2 = Table[Module[{lhs = Ω2d . op[[1]], rhs = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1, Ω1 . op[[2]]]], f}, f = (lhs . rhs)/(rhs . rhs); {op[[3]], N[Norm[N[lhs - f rhs, 30]]/Norm[N[lhs, 30]], 3], N[rank1dev[Xdiag[Ω1 . op[[2]]]], 3]}], {op, {{A2, A21, \"A=t2(θ2+h)\"}, {B2, B21, \"B=t2(θ2+h)t1(θ2-h)\"}}}];\nchecks[\"Ω1 T21^(1) is a rotation (2nd/1st sv of X)\"] = rank1dev[Xdiag[Ω1 . T1n[{2, 1}]]];\nStringReplace[ToString[{rankTab, rankTabT, checks[\"site-2 localizers on Ω: rank of <Ω|A2, <Ω|B2\"], checks[\"joint: rank of <Ω|T11 A2, <Ω|T11 B2, <Ω|T21 A2, <Ω|T21 B2\"], locS2, N[checks[\"Ω1 T21^(1) is a rotation (2nd/1st sv of X)\"], 3]}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
