  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* Exp. 4 (exact rationals, diagonal frame): <Ω|T_λ(θ1-2h) = v_λ ⊗ Ω1 + v'_λ ⊗ ω2 for all four shapes, with ω2 the second site-2 direction of <Ω|T10 *)\nMlam[l_] := Partition[Ω2d . T2n[l], d1];\nrowBasis = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Mlam[{1, 0}]], {0 ..}];\nchecks[\"<Ω|T10 site-2 space is 2-dim\"] = Length[rowBasis];\n(* ω2: a vector of the site-2 space independent of Ω1 (exact); normalize its largest entry to 1 *)\nω2 = Module[{cands = Select[rowBasis, MatrixRank[{Ω1, #}] == 2 &]}, cands[[1]]/cands[[1, Ordering[Abs[cands[[1]]], -1][[1]]]]];\nchecks[\"Ω1 in the site-2 space of <Ω|T10\"] = MatrixRank[Join[rowBasis, {Ω1}]] == 2;\n(* decomposition of each M_λ on the basis {Ω1, ω2}: M = v⊗Ω1 + v'⊗ω2 *)\ndecomp[M_] := Module[{B2 = {Ω1, ω2}, sol}, sol = Transpose[LinearSolve[Transpose[B2] . Conjugate[B2] // Identity, Identity[Transpose[Conjugate[B2] . Transpose[M]]]]]; sol];\n(* simpler: solve M = v⊗Ω1 + v'⊗ω2 row by row: for each site-1 index i, M[[i]] = v_i Ω1 + v'_i ω2 *)\ndecomp2[M_] := Module[{B2 = {Ω1, ω2}, cs}, cs = Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[B2], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]; {cs[[All, 1]], cs[[All, 2]]}];\ndecs = Table[l -> decomp2[Mlam[l]], {l, lams}];\nchecks[\"all four <Ω|T_λ(θ1-2h) lie in (site-1) ⊗ span{Ω1,ω2} (exact)\"] = And @@ Table[Mlam[l] === Transpose[{Ω1, ω2}] . {0, 0} + Outer[Times, (l /. decs)[[1]], Ω1] + Outer[Times, (l /. decs)[[2]], ω2], {l, lams}];\nvs = Table[(l /. decs)[[1]], {l, lams}]; vps = Table[(l /. decs)[[2]], {l, lams}];\nchecks[\"v'_λ = 0 for the localizing shapes {1,1},{2,1}\"] = {vps[[2]] === ConstantArray[0, d1], vps[[4]] === ConstantArray[0, d1]};\nchecks[\"rank of {Ω1, v10, v11, v20, v21, v'10, v'20}\"] = MatrixRank[Join[{Ω1}, vs, {vps[[1]], vps[[3]]}]];\nchecks[\"v'10 ∥ v'20 ?\"] = MatrixRank[{vps[[1]], vps[[3]]}];\n(* is the line Ω1 + κ ω2 inside the rotation cone? and is ω2 itself a rotation? *)\nchecks[\"ω2 is a rotation (all 2x2 minors of X vanish)\"] = Union[Flatten[Minors[Xdiag[ω2], 2]]] === {0};\nchecks[\"Ω1 + κ ω2 is a rotation for all κ (minors identically 0)\"] = Union[Flatten[Simplify[Minors[Xdiag[Ω1 + κ ω2], 2]]]] === {0};\nStringReplace[ToString[KeyTake[checks, {\"<Ω|T10 site-2 space is 2-dim\", \"Ω1 in the site-2 space of <Ω|T10\", \"all four <Ω|T_λ(θ1-2h) lie in (site-1) ⊗ span{Ω1,ω2} (exact)\", \"v'_λ = 0 for the localizing shapes {1,1},{2,1}\", \"rank of {Ω1, v10, v11, v20, v21, v'10, v'20}\", \"v'10 ∥ v'20 ?\", \"ω2 is a rotation (all 2x2 minors of X vanish)\", \"Ω1 + κ ω2 is a rotation for all κ (minors identically 0)\"}], InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
