       "data": "Out[399]= \\text{<|\\<$\\Omega$|T10 site-2 space is 2-dim\\ -> 2, \\$\\Omega$1 in the site-2 space of <$\\Omega$|T10\\ -> True, \\all four <$\\Omega$|T\\_$\\lambda$($\\theta$1-2h) lie in (site-1) $\\otimes$ span\\{$\\Omega$1,$\\omega$2\\} (exact)\\ -> True, \\v'\\_$\\lambda$ = 0 for the localizing shapes \\{1,1\\},\\{2,1\\}\\ -> \\{True, True\\},  ank of \\{$\\Omega$1, v10, v11, v20, v21, v'10, v'20\\}\\ -> 6, \\v'10 $\\|$ v'20 ?\\ -> 2, \\$\\omega$2 is a rotation (all 2x2 minors of X vanish)\\ -> True, \\$\\Omega$1 + $\\kappa$ $\\omega$2 is a rotation for all $\\kappa$ (minors identically 0)\\ -> True|>}",
