  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* product locus of Φ(c) = <Ω|(c0 + c1 T10 + c2 T11 + c3 T20 + c4 T21) = v(c)⊗Ω1 + v'(c)⊗ω2: product iff v'(c) ∧ v(c) = 0; then the factors are v(c) and Ω1 + κω2 with κ = v'/v *)\ncs5 = {c0, c1, c2, c3, c4};\nvC = c0 Ω1 + c1 vs[[1]] + c2 vs[[2]] + c3 vs[[3]] + c4 vs[[4]];\nvpC = c1 vps[[1]] + c3 vps[[3]];\nprodEqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[{vC, vpC}, 2]]], 0];\nprodSol = Solve[prodEqs == 0, cs5];\n(* on each product component: rotation condition for the site-1 factor v(c) *)\nrotOnComp[sol_] := Module[{v = vC /. sol, free, eqs}, free = Complement[cs5, First /@ sol]; eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Simplify[Minors[Xdiag[v], 2]]]], 0]; {sol, free, Solve[eqs == 0, free]}];\nrotSols = rotOnComp /@ prodSol;\nStringReplace[ToString[{Length[prodSol], prodSol, rotSols}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
