  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (B) is f* the ladder-1 contour det f_y for some y*? f_y with symbolic y: E = y^(-(x-θ1)/h) = y^n at x = θ1 - n h *)\nsu2det1S[B_, y_] := Det[Table[{-br1[Function[x, QU[B, j, x] y^(-(x - th1)/hN)]], br1[Function[x, QU[B, j, x - hN] y^(-(x - th1)/hN)]]}, {j, {3, 2}}]];\nfyS = Table[Expand[su2det1S[B, y]/minor1[B]], {B, nS}];\ndegY = Max[Exponent[fyS, y]];\nbasis5 = Transpose[{ones, τ10, τ11, τ20, τ21}];\ncPow = Table[LeastSquares[basis5, Coefficient[fyS, y, p]], {p, 0, degY}];\nchecks[\"f_y: every y-power coefficient in span{1,τ} (max rel residual)\"] = Max[Table[Norm[basis5 . cPow[[p + 1]] - Coefficient[fyS, y, p]]/Max[Norm[Coefficient[fyS, y, p]], 10^-30], {p, 0, degY}]];\ncY = Sum[y^p cPow[[p + 1]], {p, 0, degY}];\nminY = DeleteCases[Union[Chop[Expand[Flatten[Minors[{cY, cStar}, 2]]], 10^-35]], 0];\nroots1 = y /. NSolve[minY[[1]] == 0, y, WorkingPrecision -> 40];\nyStar = Select[roots1, Max[Abs[minY /. y -> #]] < 10^-25 &];\n(* also: the 2nd singular value of Φ_y along real y (is rank 2 generic?) *)\ns2y = Table[{yy, N[svRel[covOf[fL1[yy]]][[2]], 3]}, {yy, {-5, -2, -1/2, 1/3, 1/2, 2, 5, 20}}];\nStringReplace[ToString[{degY, N[checks[\"f_y: every y-power coefficient in span{1,τ} (max rel residual)\"], 3], N[cPow, 4], N[roots1, 6], yStar, s2y}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
