  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (C) enlarged operator family: all low-rank <Ω|O for O in {1, T10, T11, T20, T21 at θ1-2h, t2(θ1), t2(θ2+h), t2(θ2+h)t1(θ2-h)}; exact product locus via the site-2 row space *)\nopsExt = {{\"1\", IdentityMatrix[d2]}, {\"T10\", T2n[{1, 0}]}, {\"T11\", T2n[{1, 1}]}, {\"T20\", T2n[{2, 0}]}, {\"T21\", T2n[{2, 1}]}, {\"t2(θ1)\", tZv[2, thN[[1]]]}, {\"t2(θ2+h)\", A2}, {\"t2(θ2+h)t1(θ2-h)\", B2}};\nMext = Table[Partition[Ω2d . op[[2]], d1], {op, opsExt}];\nS2 = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Join @@ Mext], {0 ..}];\nchecks[\"enlarged family: site-2 row-space dimension\"] = Length[S2];\nVdec = Table[Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[S2], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]], {M, Mext}];  (* Vdec[[k, a]] = site-1 vector multiplying s_a in M_k *)\ncE = Array[e, Length[opsExt]];\nVa = Table[Sum[cE[[k]] Vdec[[k, a]], {k, Length[opsExt]}], {a, Length[S2]}];\nprodEqsE = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[Va, 2]]], 0];\nprodSolE = TimeConstrained[Solve[prodEqsE == 0, cE], 300, $Failed];\n(* classify components: dimension (free parameters), and the rotation solve for the site-1 factor *)\ncompE = If[prodSolE === $Failed, $Failed, Table[Module[{free = Complement[cE, First /@ sol], v1, eqs, rs}, v1 = First[Select[Va /. sol, # =!= ConstantArray[0, d1] &, 1] /. {} -> {ConstantArray[0, d1]}];\n   eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Simplify[Minors[Xdiag[v1], 2]]]], 0]; rs = If[eqs === {}, \"all rotations\", TimeConstrained[Solve[eqs == 0, free], 120, \"timeout\"]]; {sol, free, rs}], {sol, prodSolE}]];\nStringReplace[ToString[{checks[\"enlarged family: site-2 row-space dimension\"], If[prodSolE === $Failed, \"Solve timed out\", Length[prodSolE]], compE}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
