  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* (C') on each product component: site-1 factor v1 = a nonzero V_a, site-2 factor w2 = sum_a (V_a/v1) s_a; solve the joint rotation conditions for both factors over the free parameters *)\nopNames = opsExt[[All, 1]];\nclassify[sol_] := Module[{free, Vs, a1, v1, κs, w2, eqs, rs},\n  free = Complement[cE, First /@ sol]; Vs = Va /. sol;\n  a1 = First[FirstPosition[Vs, v_ /; v =!= ConstantArray[0, d1], {1}, Heads -> False]]; v1 = Vs[[a1]];\n  κs = Table[With[{Vb = Vs[[b]]}, If[Vb === ConstantArray[0, d1], 0, Simplify[(Vb . v1)/(v1 . v1)]]], {b, Length[S2]}];\n  w2 = κs . S2;\n  eqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Simplify[Join[Minors[Xdiag[v1], 2], Minors[Xdiag[w2], 2]]]]], 0];\n  rs = If[eqs === {}, \"all\", TimeConstrained[Solve[eqs == 0, free], 120, \"timeout\"]];\n  {Thread[opNames -> (cE /. sol)], free, rs}];\ncompE2 = classify /@ prodSolE;\n(* keep only components with a nontrivial rotation solution (not forcing all free params to zero) *)\nnontriv = Select[compE2, #[[3]] === \"all\" || (ListQ[#[[3]]] && AnyTrue[#[[3]], Function[s, Length[Complement[#[[2]], First /@ s]] > 0 || AnyTrue[Values[s], # =!= 0 &]]]) &];\nStringReplace[ToString[{Length[compE2], Length[nontriv], nontriv}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">4 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Solve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all &quot;solve&quot; variables.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of Solve::svars will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
