   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* the whole construction as a function of the one-site twisted vacuum Ω1x (diag frame), ket twist z fixed: returns {ω2 data, product point c*, κ*, y* (from the contour-det curve), rotation parameters a of v*, site-2 factor, Ω1x, ω2} *)\npipeline[Ω1x_] := Module[{Ω2x, Ml, rb, ω2x, dec, vsx, vpsx, vCx, vpCx, pe, ps, comp, cst, vst, vpst, κst, ovl, cov, fy, cP, cYx, mY, r1, ys},\n  Ω2x = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[Ω1x, Ω1x]];\n  Ml[l_] := Partition[Ω2x . T2n[l], d1];\n  rb = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Ml[{1, 0}]], {0 ..}];\n  ω2x = Module[{cands = Select[rb, MatrixRank[{Ω1x, #}] == 2 &]}, cands[[1]]/cands[[1, Ordering[Abs[cands[[1]]], -1][[1]]]]];\n  dec[M_] := Module[{cs = Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[{Ω1x, ω2x}], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]}, {cs[[All, 1]], cs[[All, 2]]}];\n  vsx = Table[dec[Ml[l]][[1]], {l, lams}]; vpsx = Table[dec[Ml[l]][[2]], {l, lams}];\n  vCx = c0 Ω1x + c1 vsx[[1]] + c2 vsx[[2]] + c3 vsx[[3]] + c4 vsx[[4]]; vpCx = c1 vpsx[[1]] + c3 vpsx[[3]];\n  pe = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[{vCx, vpCx}, 2]]], 0]; ps = Solve[pe == 0, cs5];\n  (* the component with c1, c3 both nonzero *)\n  comp = First[Select[ps, FreeQ[#, c1 -> 0] && FreeQ[#, c3 -> 0] && Length[#] == 4 &]];\n  cst = (cs5 /. comp) /. c3 -> 1; vst = vCx /. Thread[cs5 -> cst]; vpst = vpCx /. Thread[cs5 -> cst]; κst = (vpst . vst)/(vst . vst);\n  (* y* from the contour-det curve c(y) (ket Q's only, so cPow is the same as before) *)\n  mY = DeleteCases[Union[Chop[Expand[Flatten[Minors[{cY, cst}, 2]]], 10^-35]], 0];\n  r1 = y /. NSolve[mY[[1]] == 0, y, WorkingPrecision -> 40]; ys = Select[r1, Max[Abs[mY /. y -> #]] < 10^-25 &];\n  {\"c*\" -> cst, \"κ*\" -> κst, \"y*\" -> Rationalize[Re[ys], 10^-25], \"v* rotation\" -> (Union[Flatten[Minors[Xdiag[vst], 2]]] === {0}), \"site2 rotation\" -> (Union[Flatten[Minors[Xdiag[Ω1x + κst ω2x], 2]]] === {0}), \"a(v*)\" -> abOf[vst][[1]], \"a(site2)\" -> abOf[Ω1x + κst ω2x][[1]], \"a(Ω1)\" -> abOf[Ω1x][[1]], \"a(ω2)\" -> abOf[ω2x][[1]]}];\npipeW = pipeline[Ω1]; pipeWp = pipeline[Ω1P];\nStringReplace[ToString[{\"w\" -> pipeW, \"w'\" -> pipeWp}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
