       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Syntax::sntxf: \\\" z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"(* self-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"(* self-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"ained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"self-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"elf-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"lf-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"* self-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"(* self-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"g->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"(* self-contained pipeline in (z, w): rebuilds Ω1, the L=2 fused T's at θ1-2h and the diag->companion map for the given ket twist z; no Q's needed (y* read off from the site-2 factor Ω_{(w1, y*)}). Globals (zN, tZ, T2n, Pph1, ...) are NOT modified. NB: local names must not shadow globals used inside (ps = GT patterns). *)\\\".\\nSolve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\\nSolve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\\nSolve::svars: Equations may not give solutions for all \\\"solve\\\" variables.\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
