   "value": "(* identification of the site-1 factor: candidates Ω_w ρ(M) with M built from the ket twist G(z) and y* (companion frame: Ωc[w]; ρG, cmpScale as in cell 69); compare with v* (diag frame -> companion by .Pph1) up to scale *)\nρG[m_] := MatrixExp[Sum[MatrixLog[m][[i, k]] N[Ee[i, k], prec], {i, 3}, {k, 3}]];\nGzN = N[Gc[zN], prec];\ncmpScale[u_, v_] := Module[{s = (u . v)/(v . v)}, {s, Norm[u - s v]/Norm[u]}];\nyS = wN[[2]] (thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - hN)/(thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - 2 hN);\nchecks[\"y* formula = -63/8 at the original point\"] = (yS == -63/8);\nvStarC = vStar . Pph1;\ncands = {\"ρ((y*-G^T)^-1)\" -> ρG[Inverse[yS IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]]], \"ρ((y*-G)^-1)\" -> ρG[Inverse[yS IdentityMatrix[3] - GzN]], \"ρ(y*-G^T)\" -> ρG[yS IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]], \"ρ(y*-G)\" -> ρG[yS IdentityMatrix[3] - GzN], \"ρ((1-G^T/y*)^-1)\" -> ρG[Inverse[IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]/yS]]};\nidTab = Table[c[[1]] -> N[Last[cmpScale[N[vStarC, 40], N[Ωc[wN] . c[[2]], 40]]], 3], {c, cands}];\n(* also: is v* = Ω_{(p,q)} for some (p,q), i.e. a(v*) = (1, -(p+q), pq): discriminant *)\nav = abOf[vStar][[1]]; discV = av[[2]]^2 - 4 av[[3]];\n(* independent check of the y* formula at a fresh point: h = 1/5, θ = (1/3, -1/7), z = (3/2, 7/6, 2/3), twist w' *)\nrunNew = pipelineZH[{3/2, 7/6, 2/3}, wP, 1/5, {1/3, -1/7}];\nySnew = wP[[2]] (1/3 + 1/7 - 1/5)/(1/3 + 1/7 - 2/5);\nchecks[\"y* formula at the fresh point\"] = ((\"y*\" /. runNew) == ySnew);\nStringReplace[ToString[{checks[\"y* formula = -63/8 at the original point\"], idTab, discV, \"y*\" /. runNew, ySnew, checks[\"y* formula at the fresh point\"], (\"site2 = Ω(w1,y*)?\" /. runNew), (\"v* rotation\" /. runNew)}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
