  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* v* vs candidates. (i) paper-style: the one-site vacuum with Gauss parameters r_k rescaled by ratios (1 - z_a/y*)/(1 - z_b/y*) (G14 of 2603.26617 with κ = 1/y*), all index assignments and inverses; (ii) Ω_{(p,q)} ρ(M) for p,q in {w1,w2,y*} and resolvent-type M. Residual = relative distance up to scale (diag frame). *)\nrOmN = {r1 -> (w[1] - z[1])/(w[1] - z[2]), r2 -> ((w[1] - z[1]) (-w[2] + z[1]) (z[2] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (w[2] - z[3])), r3 -> ((w[1] - z[2]) (-w[2] + z[2]) (z[1] - z[3]))/((z[1] - z[2]) (w[1] - z[3]) (-w[2] + z[3]))} /. numZW;\nvacR[{rr1_, rr2_, rr3_}] := First[{UnitVector[d1, 1]} . MatrixExp[rr1 Ee[1, 2]] . MatrixExp[rr2 Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[rr3 Ee[2, 3]]];\nresid[v_] := Last[cmpScale[N[vStar, 40], N[v, 40]]];\nfac[a_, b_] := (1 - zN[[a]]/yS)/(1 - zN[[b]]/yS);\n(* each r_k (k ~ generator E_{ab}: r1~E12, r2~E13, r3~E23) gets a factor fac[p,q]^e with (p,q) in all ordered index pairs and e in {-1,0,1}; scan *)\npairs = Tuples[Range[3], 2]; exps = {-1, 0, 1};\nscan1 = Flatten[Table[Module[{f1 = fac @@ p1, f2 = fac @@ p2, f3 = fac @@ p3, rs}, rs = {(r1 /. rOmN) f1^e1, (r2 /. rOmN) f2^e2, (r3 /. rOmN) f3^e3}; {N[resid[vacR[rs]], 3], {p1, e1}, {p2, e2}, {p3, e3}}], {p1, pairs}, {e1, exps}, {p2, pairs}, {e2, exps}, {p3, pairs}, {e3, exps}], 5];\nbest1 = Take[SortBy[scan1, First], 6];\n(* (ii) vacuum-type candidates with resolvents *)\nvacPQ[p_, q_] := oneSiteVac[zN, {p, q, wN[[3]]}];\nMs = {\"res(y*)^T\" -> Inverse[yS IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]], \"res(y*)\" -> Inverse[yS IdentityMatrix[3] - GzN], \"res(w2)^T\" -> Inverse[wN[[2]] IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]], \"res(w1)^T\" -> Inverse[wN[[1]] IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]], \"1\" -> IdentityMatrix[3]};\npq = {{wN[[1]], wN[[2]]}, {wN[[1]], yS}, {wN[[2]], yS}, {yS, wN[[1]]}, {wN[[2]], wN[[1]]}};\nscan2 = Flatten[Table[{N[resid[(vacPQ @@ pqv) . Pph1 . Inverse[Pph1] // Identity], 3] /. _ -> N[Last[cmpScale[N[vStarC, 40], N[(vacPQ @@ pqv) . Pph1 . (ρG[m[[2]]]), 40]]], 3], pqv, m[[1]]}, {pqv, pq}, {m, Ms}], 1];\nbest2 = Take[SortBy[scan2, First], 6];\nStringReplace[ToString[{best1, best2}, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
