       "data": "Syntax::sntxf: \"(* closed-form state (companion frame): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)\" cannot be followed by \"}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \"(* closed-form state (companion frame): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \"e): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \"ion frame): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \" w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \"v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \"form state (companion frame): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \" closed-form state (companion frame): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \"(* closed-form state (companion frame): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".\nSyntax::sntxf: \"\" cannot be followed by \"e (companion frame): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y*)}, v1 = v2 . ρ((w2 - G(z)^T)^-1); y* = w2 (θ12 - h)/(θ12 - 2h) *)\".",
