      {
       "data": "{\n\t\"name\": \"WolframKernelMessage\",\n\t\"message\": \"Syntax::sntxf: \\\" h and (θ12 - k h): from the three (h,θ) points use c* ∝ c(y*)\\\" cannot be followed by \\\": A0/A3 = c0/y*^2, A1/A3 = c1/y*, A2/A3 = c2, A4/A3 = c4 y* (c3 = 1) *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"fficients A_k (of y^{4-?}τ_k) as monomials in h and (θ12 - k h): from the three (h,θ) points use c* ∝ c(y*): A0/A3 = c0/y*^2, A1/A3 = c1/y*, A2/A3 = c2, A4/A3 = c4 y* (c3 = 1) *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"* (2) the coefficients A_k (of y^{4-?}τ_k) as monomials in h and (θ12 - k h): from the three (h,θ) points use c* ∝ c(y*): A0/A3 = c0/y*^2, A1/A3 = c1/y*, A2/A3 = c2, A4/A3 = c4 y* (c3 = 1) *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"fficients A_k (of y^{4-?}τ_k) as monomials in h and (θ12 - k h): from the three (h,θ) points use c* ∝ c(y*): A0/A3 = c0/y*^2, A1/A3 = c1/y*, A2/A3 = c2, A4/A3 = c4 y* (c3 = 1) *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"coefficients A_k (of y^{4-?}τ_k) as monomials in h and (θ12 - k h): from the three (h,θ) points use c* ∝ c(y*): A0/A3 = c0/y*^2, A1/A3 = c1/y*, A2/A3 = c2, A4/A3 = c4 y* (c3 = 1) *)\\\".\\nSyntax::sntxf: \\\"\\\" cannot be followed by \\\"_k (of y^{4-?}τ_k) as monomials in h and (θ12 - k h): from the three (h,θ) points use c* ∝ c(y*): A0/A3 = c0/y*^2, A1/A3 = c1/y*, A2/A3 = c2, A4/A3 = c4 y* (c3 = 1) *)\\\".\",\n\t\"stack\": \"\"\n}",
