  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Exact $\\tau$-expansion of the ladder-1 contour determinant (cell 104).** The rational coefficients reproduce the 60-digit data to $10^{-49}$, and from the three $(h,\\theta)$ points (via $c^*\\propto c(y^*)$) each coefficient is a unique monomial in $h$ and $(\\theta_{12}-kh)$:\n$$\\det_2^{(1)}[Q_B;y]/{\\rm minor}_1\\ \\propto\\ 2h^2(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-2h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)\\,y^4+2h(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)\\,y^3\\tau_{10}+(\\theta_{12}-h)\\,y^2\\tau_{11}+(\\theta_{12}-3h)\\,y^2\\tau_{20}+\\frac{2}{3h}\\,y\\,\\tau_{21},$$\nall $\\tau_\\lambda$ at $\\theta_1-2h$ (overall normalization: in the notebook's conventions the coefficient of $y^2\\tau_{20}$ is $1/(h^3(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-2h))$). At P1 ($h=1/2$, $\\theta_{12}=31/35$: $\\theta_{12}-h=27/70$, $\\theta_{12}-2h=-8/70$, $\\theta_{12}-3h=-43/70$) this is $4y^4-70y^3\\tau_{10}+\\tfrac{4900}{43}y^2\\tau_{11}-\\tfrac{4900}{27}y^2\\tau_{20}+\\tfrac{1372000}{3483}y\\tau_{21}$. The localization prefactors at P1 are likewise $f_{11}=(\\theta_{12}-h)(\\theta_{12}-3h)=-1161/4900$ and $f_{21}=(\\theta_{12}-h)^2(\\theta_{12}-3h)=-31347/343000$, so in terms of $\\hat\\tau_\\lambda=\\tau_\\lambda/f_\\lambda$ the $\\tau_{11},\\tau_{21}$ terms read $-27\\hat\\tau_{11}y^2-36\\hat\\tau_{21}y$ at P1.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* y as the free parameter: for any y, w2(y) = y (θ12 - 2h)/(θ12 - h) makes y = y*(w). Test at y = 3 (and y = -1/2) with w1 kept, w3 arbitrary. *)\nyFreeTest[yy_] := Module[{w2y, wY, v2, v1, Φ, ovl, FvY, ratio},\n  w2y = yy (thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - 2 hN)/(thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - hN); wY = {wN[[1]], w2y, wN[[3]]};\n  v2 = Ωc[{wN[[1]], yy, wN[[3]]}]; v1 = v2 . ρG[Inverse[w2y IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]]];\n  Φ = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1, v2]]; ovl = Table[(Φ . ketC[[B]])/(x0C . ketC[[B]]), {B, nS}];\n  FvY = vacQ[wY];\n  If[FvY === $Failed, {yy, w2y, \"vac Q's not found\"},\n   ratio = Table[ovl[[B]]/((det6[B, FvY]/psiQ[B]) (su2det1[B, yy]/minor1[B])), {B, nS}];\n   {yy, w2y, N[Max[Abs[ratio/ratio[[1]] - 1]], 3], N[rank1dev[Xmat[v1]], 3], N[rank1dev[Xmat[v2]], 3], MatrixRank[N[{v1, v2}, 30]]}]];\nyFree = {yFreeTest[3], yFreeTest[-1/2]};\nchecks[\"y free: identity at y = 3, -1/2 with w2 = y(θ12-2h)/(θ12-h) (state-independence)\"] = yFree[[All, 3]];\nStringReplace[ToString[yFree, InputForm], \"\\n\" -> \" \"]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
