      {
       "data": "Out[631]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|}\\hline\\text{torus = character, random covectors (rel dev)} & 0.\\times 10^{-60}\\\\\\hline\\text{ranks \\{fixed y, y free, torus alone\\} at 3 points} & \\begin{pmatrix}3 & 4 & 3\\\\3 & 4 & 3\\\\3 & 4 & 3\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{fibre tangents (w1, y, d1, d2, d3)} & \\begin{pmatrix}1.\\, & 0 & 0.002600 & 0.01517 & -0.01475\\\\1.\\, & 0 & -0.03704 & -0.1270 & -1.477\\\\1.\\, & 0 & 0.7111 & -8.296 & 3.884\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\text{$\\Omega$\\_\\{(w1,y)\\} / $\\Omega$\\_\\{(w1',y)\\} a torus character? (residuals)} & \\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
