  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 11.2 the (w1, y) family of §10 at a FRESH w1 (all §10 determinant checks had w1 = 5/2): v2 = Ω_{(w1,y)}, v1 = v2 ρ((w2(y) - G^T)^-1), w2(y) = y(θ12-2h)/(θ12-h); overlap ∝ det6[Q_vac,(w1,w2(y))] x ladder-1 det2(y). Needed before the torus argument is applied, since that argument moves w1. (y must avoid the ket twist z: Ω_{(w1,y)} degenerates at y = z_i — the first run used y = 5/4 = z2 and gave 0/0.) *)\nw2Of[yy_] := yy (thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - 2 hN)/(thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - hN);\nyOf[kinv_] := kinv (thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - hN)/(thN[[1]] - thN[[2]] - 2 hN);   (* inverse: resolvent parameter kinv = w2(y) -> y *)\nfamTest[w1_, yy_] := Module[{w2y = w2Of[yy], v2, v1, Φ, ovlF, FvT, ratio},\n  v2 = Ωc[{w1, yy, 3/5}]; v1 = v2 . ρG[Inverse[w2y IdentityMatrix[3] - Transpose[GzN]]];\n  Φ = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1, v2]]; ovlF = Table[(Φ . ketC[[B]])/(x0C . ketC[[B]]), {B, nS}];\n  FvT = vacQ[{w1, w2y, 3/5}];\n  If[FvT === $Failed, {w1, yy, w2y, \"vac Q's not found\"},\n   ratio = Table[ovlF[[B]]/((det6[B, FvT]/psiQ[B]) (su2det1[B, yy]/minor1[B])), {B, nS}];\n   {w1, yy, w2y, N[Max[Abs[ratio/ratio[[1]] - 1]], 3], N[rank1dev[Xmat[v1]], 3], N[rank1dev[Xmat[v2]], 3], MatrixRank[N[{v1, v2}, 30]]}]];\nfam2 = {famTest[-7/3, 7/5], famTest[9/4, -2/3]};\nchecks[\"11.2 (w1,y) family at fresh w1: state-independence\"] = fam2[[All, 4]];\nGrid[Prepend[fam2, {\"w1\", \"y\", \"w2(y)\", \"max rel dev (64 states)\", \"v1 rotation?\", \"v2 rotation?\", \"rank{v1,v2}\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
