     "id": "58602089-d84e-4b7b-95bf-8cc08024919f"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 11.3 iterate the §10 mechanism with the product state itself as the seed: Φ0 = v1⊗v2 in the diagonal frame with exact rationals (v2 = Ω_{(w1, yS)}, v1 = v2 ρdiag[1/(w2 - z)]). Act with the site-1 span {1, T10, T11, T20, T21}(θ1-2h) and ask for the product locus again. With the vacuum seed (cell 92) the site-2 column space was 2-dim and the locus had one nontrivial point; a larger column space here makes the product condition stiffer. *)\nv2d = oneSiteVac[zN, {wN[[1]], yS, wN[[3]]}]; v1d = v2d . ρdiag[Dy[wN[[2]]]];\nchecks[\"11.3 seed = §10 state (diag frame vs companion v1C, v2C: rel dev)\"] = {Last[cmpScale[N[v1d . Pph1, 40], N[v1C, 40]]], Last[cmpScale[N[v2d . Pph1, 40], N[v2C, 40]]]};\nΦ0d = Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1d, v2d]];\nMlS[l_] := Partition[Φ0d . T2n[l], d1];\ncolSpan = Join[{Partition[Φ0d, d1]}, Table[MlS[l], {l, lams}]];   (* 5 matrices 8x8: rows = site 1, columns = site 2 *)\nchecks[\"11.3 site-2 column space of {Φ0, Φ0 T_λ}: rank\"] = MatrixRank[Flatten[colSpan, 1]];\nchecks[\"11.3 site-1 row space of {Φ0, Φ0 T_λ}: rank\"] = MatrixRank[Flatten[Transpose /@ colSpan, 1]];\nchecks[\"11.3 ranks of the five 8x8 matrices\"] = MatrixRank /@ colSpan;\n(* product locus: write each matrix as sum_j A_j ⊗ β_j over a basis β of the site-2 column space; Φ(c) is rank 1 iff the r site-1 vectors a_j(c) = sum_k c_k A_{kj} are all parallel (2x2 minors of the r x 8 matrix vanish) *)\nβbasis = DeleteCases[RowReduce[Flatten[colSpan, 1]], {0 ..}];\ndecA[M_] := Transpose[Table[LinearSolve[Transpose[βbasis], M[[i]]], {i, d1}]];\nAcoef = decA /@ colSpan;\naOfC = Sum[cs5[[k]] Acoef[[k]], {k, 5}];\nprodEqs = DeleteCases[Union[Flatten[Minors[aOfC, 2]]], 0];\n{solTime, solProd} = AbsoluteTiming[Solve[prodEqs == 0, cs5]];\n(* classify every solution component: substitute random values for free parameters, test rank 1, rotation of each factor, and whether the factors are the seed's *)\nclassifyP[sol_] := Module[{cc, free, M, rowi, colj, f1, f2}, cc = cs5 /. sol; free = Variables[cc]; cc = cc /. Thread[free -> RandomInteger[{2, 9}, Length[free]]];\n   M = Sum[cc[[k]] colSpan[[k]], {k, 5}];\n   If[Union[Flatten[M]] === {0}, {Length[free], \"zero\", \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\", cc},\n    rowi = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {2}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; colj = First[FirstPosition[Total[Abs[M], {1}], _?(# != 0 &)]]; f1 = M[[All, colj]]; f2 = M[[rowi, All]];\n    {Length[free], Union[Flatten[Minors[M, 2]]] === {0}, Union[Flatten[Minors[Xdiag[f1], 2]]] === {0}, Union[Flatten[Minors[Xdiag[f2], 2]]] === {0}, MatrixRank[{f1, v1d}] == 1, MatrixRank[{f2, v2d}] == 1, cc}]];\nSeedRandom[113]; classP = classifyP /@ solProd;\nGrid[Join[{{\"seed = §10 state (rel dev)\", checks[\"11.3 seed = §10 state (diag frame vs companion v1C, v2C: rel dev)\"]}, {\"site-2 column-space rank\", checks[\"11.3 site-2 column space of {Φ0, Φ0 T_λ}: rank\"]}, {\"site-1 row-space rank\", checks[\"11.3 site-1 row space of {Φ0, Φ0 T_λ}: rank\"]}, {\"ranks of Φ0, Φ0T10, Φ0T11, Φ0T20, Φ0T21\", checks[\"11.3 ranks of the five 8x8 matrices\"]}, {\"# quadrics, Solve time (s), # components\", {Length[prodEqs], N[solTime, 3], Length[solProd]}}, {\"components: {free params, rank1, site1 rot, site2 rot, site1 = v1?, site2 = v2?, c}\", \"\"}}, {#} & /@ classP], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
