  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 12.3-12.5 weights and per-weight ranks (spec 4.3-4.5). (a) numeric sample: 12 rational y's; (b) exact in y: phi(y) with y symbolic, Together, numerator coefficient vectors per weight (the span of the values phi(y) restricted to a weight mu over all y equals the span of these coefficient vectors); (c) which components vanish identically. *)\nu12wt1 = Table[Table[J0[k][p], {k, 3}], {p, ps[{Λ}]}];\nu12wts = Union[u12wt1];\nu12idx = Table[Flatten[Position[u12wt1, m]], {m, u12wts}];\nu12dims = Length /@ u12idx;\nu12ys = {7/5, -2/3, 3, -1/2, 11/9, 4/7, -9/5, 13/6, -3/11, 8/3, 1/6, -7/4};\nu12rankNum[zz_, w1s_List] := Table[MatrixRank[Flatten[Table[u12phi[zz, w1, yy][[idx]], {w1, w1s}, {yy, u12ys}], 1]], {idx, u12idx}];\n{u12tNum, u12rkNum} = AbsoluteTiming[u12rankNum[zN, {u12w1}]];\nchecks[\"12.4 weights of V (Union order)\"] = u12wts;\nchecks[\"12.4 dim V_mu\"] = u12dims;\nchecks[\"12.4 numeric-sample ranks (w1=-7/3, 12 y's)\"] = u12rkNum;\n(* exact in y *)\n{u12tSym, u12phiY} = AbsoluteTiming[Together /@ u12phi[zN, u12w1, yS]];\nu12coefRank[comps_] := Module[{tg = Together /@ comps, den, num, cl, mx}, den = PolynomialLCM @@ (Denominator /@ tg); num = Expand[tg den]; cl = CoefficientList[#, yS] & /@ num; mx = Max[Length /@ cl]; MatrixRank[Transpose[PadRight[#, mx] & /@ cl]]];\nu12rkSym = Table[u12coefRank[u12phiY[[idx]]], {idx, u12idx}];\nchecks[\"12.5 exact-in-y ranks (w1=-7/3)\"] = u12rkSym;\nchecks[\"12.5 components of phi(y) vanishing identically\"] = Flatten[Position[u12phiY, 0]];\nchecks[\"12.3-5 ranks equal dim V_mu for every weight (numeric and exact)\"] = (u12rkNum === u12dims) && (u12rkSym === u12dims) && (checks[\"12.5 components of phi(y) vanishing identically\"] === {});\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[{u12wts, u12dims, u12rkNum, u12rkSym}], {\"weight\", \"dim V_mu\", \"rank (numeric, 12 y)\", \"rank (exact in y)\"}] // Transpose // Transpose, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607003\" data-output-id=\"47\" data-out-n=\"669\" data-sub-idx=\"18\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"115\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[669]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.64em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">weight</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</