  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 12.6 closed forms (spec 4.6 / section 3): n' = Delta^-1 n Delta n^-1 with y symbolic, rational z, w1, theta, h. (i) b' = 0 iff omega = y (so b' is nonzero on the family because w2(y) != y); (ii) b'/(a'c') = (y - omega)/(y - z2); (iii) weight components of phi(y) = delta^Lambda e1^T rho(n'). The blind-spot control replaces the resolvent point omega by y itself. *)\nu12om = w2Of[yS];\nu12delta[om_] := Table[1/(om - zN[[k]]), {k, 3}];\nu12primes[om_] := Module[{n = u12nMat[zN, u12w1, yS], dl = DiagonalMatrix[u12delta[om]]}, Together /@ (Inverse[dl] . n . dl . Inverse[n])];\nu12np = u12primes[u12om];\nu12ap = u12np[[1, 2]]; u12bp = u12np[[1, 3]]; u12cp = u12np[[2, 3]];\n(* explicit formulas of the spec as an independent check of the matrix product *)\nu12rr = u12rs[zN, u12w1, yS]; u12d = u12delta[u12om];\nchecks[\"12.6 n' is unipotent upper triangular\"] = (u12np[[2, 1]] === 0) && (u12np[[3, 1]] === 0) && (u12np[[3, 2]] === 0) && (u12np[[1, 1]] === 1) && (u12np[[2, 2]] === 1) && (u12np[[3, 3]] === 1);\nchecks[\"12.6 a', c', b' match the spec formulas\"] = {Simplify[u12ap - u12rr[[1]] (u12d[[2]] - u12d[[1]])/u12d[[1]]], Simplify[u12cp - u12rr[[3]] (u12d[[3]] - u12d[[2]])/u12d[[2]]], Simplify[u12bp - (u12rr[[1]] u12rr[[3]] (u12d[[1]] - u12d[[2]])/u12d[[1]] - (u12rr[[2]] + u12rr[[1]] u12rr[[3]]) (u12d[[1]] - u12d[[3]])/u12d[[1]])]};\nchecks[\"12.6 (ii) b'/(a'c') - (y - omega)/(y - z2) = 0 exactly\"] = Simplify[u12bp/(u12ap u12cp) - (yS - u12om)/(yS - zN[[2]])];\nchecks[\"12.6 (i) b' numerator vanishes iff omega = y: b' (omega -> y control) = 0\"] = Simplify[u12primes[yS][[1, 3]]];\nchecks[\"12.6 (i) b' zero locus in y (for omega = w2(y))\"] = Solve[Numerator[Together[u12bp]] == 0, yS];\n(* (iii) phi(y) = delta^Lambda e1^T rho(n') with rho(n') = exp(c' E23) exp(b' E13) exp(a' E12) at rep level *)\nu12phiForm[ap_, bp_, cp_, d_] := (d[[1]]^2 d[[2]]) u12e1 . MatrixExp[cp Ee[2, 3]] . MatrixExp[bp Ee[1, 3]] . MatrixExp[ap Ee[1, 2]];\nchecks[\"12.6 phi(y) = delta^Lambda e1^T rho(n') (exact, y symbolic)\"] = Union[Simplify[u12phiY - u12phiForm[u12ap, u12bp, u12cp, u12d]]] === {0};\nu12tab = Grid[{{\"a'\", Factor[u12ap]}, {\"c'\", Factor[u12cp]}, {\"b'\", Factor[u12bp]}, {\"b'/(a'c')\", Factor[u12bp/(u12ap u12cp)]}, {\"(y-omega)/(y-z2)\", Factor[(yS - u12om)/(yS - zN[[2]])]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left];\nu12tab",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"607003\" data-output-id=\"48\" data-out-n=\"684\" data-sub-idx=\"17\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"116\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[684]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:7.2684em;vertical-align:-3.3642em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.9042em;\"><span style=\"top:-5.8642em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.8642em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:7.2284em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-3.3642em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:3.8642em;\"><span style=\"top:-6.0291em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">a’</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.4991em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">c’</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.0547em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.01em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">b’</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.6102em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3