  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 12.6b (iii): the weight components of phi(y)/delta^Lambda are fixed constant covectors times monomials in (a',b',c'). Each component is fitted exactly (rational least squares on all 12 sample y's, exact residual) and the final one is also verified symbolically in y. Monomials: (2,1,0): 1; (1,2,0): a'; (2,0,1): c'; (1,1,1): {b', a'c'}; (0,2,1): {a'^2 c', a' b'}; (1,0,2): b'c'; (0,1,2): all three allowed terms {b'^2, a'b'c', a'^2c'^2}. DEVIATION from the spec: the fit gives (0,1,2) = 3 b'(a'c' - b') (relative to the e1-normalized covector), i.e. the second factor is (b' - a'c'), not (b' + a'c'); a'^2c'^2 does not occur. *)\nu12dl = u12d[[1]]^2 u12d[[2]];\nu12mono = <|{2,1,0} -> {1}, {1,2,0} -> {a}, {2,0,1} -> {c}, {1,1,1} -> {b, a c}, {0,2,1} -> {a^2 c, a b}, {1,0,2} -> {b c}, {0,1,2} -> {b^2, a b c, a^2 c^2}|>;\nu12abcV[yy_] := {u12ap, u12bp, u12cp} /. yS -> yy;\nu12fitW[mu_] := Module[{idx = u12idx[[First[Flatten[Position[u12wts, mu]]]]], mons = u12mono[mu], rows, sol},\n  rows = Table[Module[{abc = u12abcV[yy], ph = u12phi[zN, u12w1, yy][[idx]]/(u12dl /. yS -> yy)}, {Table[(mon /. {a -> abc[[1]], b -> abc[[2]], c -> abc[[3]]}), {mon, mons}], ph}], {yy, u12ys}];\n  sol = LeastSquares[rows[[All, 1]], rows[[All, 2]]];\n  {mu, Max[Abs[Flatten[rows[[All, 1]] . sol - rows[[All, 2]]]]], Length[mons], Flatten[sol]}];\nu12fits = u12fitW /@ u12wts;\nchecks[\"12.6b (iii) per-weight exact fit residual to the monomials (max over 12 y's)\"] = u12fits[[All, 2]];\n(* (0,1,2) component, symbolic in y: it equals 3 b'(a'c' - b') times the (0,1,2) basis covector (index 8, coefficient 1 here), and is nonzero *)\nchecks[\"12.6b (0,1,2) component = 3 b'(a'c' - b') delta^Lambda, exact in y\"] = Simplify[u12phiY[[8]] - u12dl 3 u12bp (u12ap u12cp - u12bp)] === 0;\nchecks[\"12.6b (0,1,2) fitted coefficients on {b'^2, a'b'c', a'^2c'^2}\"] = u12fits[[7, 4]];\nGrid[Prepend[u12fits, {\"weight\", \"max residual\", \"#monomials\", \"fitted coefficients (monomials x basis)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
