  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 12.7 untwisting z_k = 1 + eps phi_k, phi = (3/7, -5/4, 2/9) (spec 4.7), y symbolic, the full 8-component phi (fast enough: no need for the 3x3 shortcut). Leading eps-order per weight and the y-rank of the leading coefficient vectors (spec expectation: orders 0,1,1,2 (rank 2),3,3,4 for (2,1,0),(1,2,0),(2,0,1),(1,1,1),(0,2,1),(1,0,2),(0,1,2)). *)\nu12phZ = 1 + epsS {3/7, -5/4, 2/9};\n{u12tU, u12phE} = AbsoluteTiming[Together /@ u12phi[u12phZ, u12w1, yS]];\nu12ordTop = 7;\nu12ser[f_] := Table[Together[SeriesCoefficient[f, {epsS, 0, k}]], {k, 0, u12ordTop}];\nu12serAll = u12ser /@ u12phE;\nu12lead[idx_] := Module[{coefs = u12serAll[[idx]], ord, lead},\n  ord = Min[Table[Module[{p = Select[Range[0, u12ordTop], coefs[[j, # + 1]] =!= 0 &, 1]}, If[p === {}, 99, p[[1]]]], {j, Length[idx]}]];\n  lead = Table[coefs[[j, ord + 1]], {j, Length[idx]}]; {ord, u12coefRank[lead]}];\nu12leads = Table[u12lead[idx], {idx, u12idx}];\nchecks[\"12.7 untwisting leading eps-order and y-rank of leading coefficients per weight\"] = Thread[u12wts -> u12leads];\nchecks[\"12.7 orders match the expectation 4,3,3,2,1,1,0 (weights in Union order)\"] = u12leads[[All, 1]] === {4, 3, 3, 2, 1, 1, 0};\nchecks[\"12.7 (1,1,1) leading coefficient has y-rank 2\"] = u12leads[[4, 2]] === 2;\nGrid[Prepend[Transpose[{u12wts, u12leads[[All, 1]], u12leads[[All, 2]], u12dims}], {\"weight\", \"leading eps order\", \"y-rank of leading coeff\", \"dim V_mu\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
