  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 12.8 highest-weight count and 12.9 torus consistency (spec 4.8, 4.9). M[i,nu] = <phi(y_i)(x)e1|HW_nu> for the 12 y's and the 6 HW kets; rank over all y; per-irrep column ranks. HW weights: (4,2,0) 27, (4,1,1) and (3,3,0) the two decuplets, (3,2,1) x2 octets, (2,2,2) singlet (which decuplet is 10 and which is 10bar is immaterial here). Control: the resolvent point set to y itself (omega = y), the old blind spot, via u12phiC. Union over w1 in {-7/3, 9/4, 5/2}. *)\nClearAll[u12Hmat, u12Ms, u12McS];\nu12phiC[zz_, w1_, y_] := u12v2[zz, w1, y] . ρdiag[u12Dy[zz, y]] . u12rNinv[zz, w1, y];\nu12Hmat[phiF_, w1_] := Table[(Flatten[KroneckerProduct[phiF[zN, w1, yy], u12e1]] . #) & /@ u12HW, {yy, u12ys}];\nu12w1s = {-7/3, 9/4, 5/2};\nu12Ms = Table[u12Hmat[u12phi, w1], {w1, u12w1s}];\nu12McS = Table[u12Hmat[u12phiC, w1], {w1, u12w1s}];\nu12irr = {{1}, {2}, {3}, {4, 5}, {6}};\nu12irrNames = {\"(4,2,0) 27\", \"(4,1,1)\", \"(3,3,0)\", \"(3,2,1) octets\", \"(2,2,2) singlet\"};\nu12MU = Join @@ u12Ms;\nchecks[\"12.8 HW-count rank per w1 (omega = w2(y)), expect 6\"] = MatrixRank /@ u12Ms;\nchecks[\"12.8 HW-count rank, union over the three w1\"] = MatrixRank[u12MU];\nchecks[\"12.8 HW weights in column order\"] = u12HWwt;\nchecks[\"12.8 per-irrep column ranks (w1 = -7/3)\"] = Table[MatrixRank[u12Ms[[1]][[All, ir]]], {ir, u12irr}];\nchecks[\"12.8 per-irrep column ranks, union over w1\"] = Table[MatrixRank[u12MU[[All, ir]]], {ir, u12irr}];\nchecks[\"12.8 control (omega = y): HW-count rank per w1\"] = MatrixRank /@ u12McS;\nchecks[\"12.8 control (omega = y): per-irrep column ranks (w1 = -7/3)\"] = Table[MatrixRank[u12McS[[1]][[All, ir]]], {ir, u12irr}];\n(* 12.9 per-weight ranks for the other w1's and the union *)\nu12rkW = Table[u12rankNum[zN, {w1}], {w1, u12w1s}];\nu12rkU = u12rankNum[zN, u12w1s];\nu12rkC = Table[MatrixRank[Table[u12phiC[zN, u12w1s[[1]], yy][[idx]], {yy, u12ys}]], {idx, u12idx}];\nchecks[\"12.9 per-weight ranks at w1 = -7/3, 9/4, 5/2 and union\"] = {u12rkW, u12rkU};\nchecks[\"12.9 all per-weight ranks unchanged (= dim V_mu)\"] = (Union[Append[u12rkW, u12rkU]] === {u12dims});\nchecks[\"12.9 control (omega = y) per-weight ranks (w1 = -7/3)\"] = u12rkC;\nGrid[{{\"HW rank per w1 / union\", checks[\"12.8 HW-count rank per w1 (omega = w2(y)), expect 6\"], checks[\"12.8 HW-count rank, union over the three w1\"]}, {\"per-irrep ranks (w1=-7/3), union over w1\", checks[\"12.8 per-irrep column ranks (w1 = -7/3)\"], checks[\"12.8 per-irrep column ranks, union over w1\"]}, {\"irreps\", u12irrNames, \"\"}, {\"control omega = y: HW rank per w1, per-irrep ranks\", checks[\"12.8 control (omega = y): HW-count rank per w1\"], checks[\"12.8 control (omega = y): per-irrep column ranks (w1 = -7/3)\"]}, {\"per-weight ranks (w1 = -7/3, 9/4, 5/2), union\", u12rkW, u12rkU}, {\"control per-weight ranks\", u12wts, u12rkC}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
