  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* 12.9b the HW rank 5 at fixed w1 is a rank deficiency of the 1-parameter slice, not of the family: the null vector of M lives on the columns (4,1,1), (3,3,0) and the two octets (it says the four functions a', c', b', a'c' of y are linearly dependent), all of different weight except the octet pair. The family of 5.8 also contains the torus (v -> v rho(D) on BOTH sites), which multiplies column nu by the character chi_nu(D) = prod D_i^nu_i (cell 108) and so separates columns of different weight. Here: build the covectors v1 rho(D) (x) v2 rho(D) directly (no use of the character), 12 random (y, D) pairs, and take the HW rank; same for the control omega = y. The character identity is checked separately. *)\nSeedRandom[912];\nu12Ds = Table[Together[RandomInteger[{1, 9}, 3]/RandomInteger[{2, 7}, 3] {1, -1, 1}^RandomInteger[{0, 1}, 3]], {12}];\nu12MT[v1F_] := Table[Module[{v2 = u12v2[zN, u12w1, u12ys[[i]]], v1 = v1F[zN, u12w1, u12ys[[i]]], R = ρdiag[u12Ds[[i]]]}, Table[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1 . R, v2 . R]] . h, {h, u12HW}]], {i, 12}];\nu12MTmain = u12MT[u12v1];\nu12MTctrl = u12MT[Function[{zz, w1, y}, u12v2[zz, w1, y] . ρdiag[u12Dy[zz, y]]]];\nu12charCheck = Table[Module[{v2 = u12v2[zN, u12w1, u12ys[[i]]], v1 = u12v1[zN, u12w1, u12ys[[i]]], lhs, rhs}, lhs = Table[Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1 . ρdiag[u12Ds[[i]]], v2 . ρdiag[u12Ds[[i]]]]] . h, {h, u12HW}]; rhs = Table[(Times @@ (u12Ds[[i]]^u12HWwt[[j]])) (Flatten[KroneckerProduct[v1, v2]] . u12HW[[j]]), {j, 6}]; lhs - rhs], {i, 12}];\nchecks[\"12.9b torus = character on the HW overlaps (exact residual)\"] = Union[Flatten[u12charCheck]] === {0};\nchecks[\"12.9b torus-completed HW rank (omega = w2(y)), expect 6\"] = MatrixRank[u12MTmain];\nchecks[\"12.9b torus-completed per-irrep ranks\"] = Table[MatrixRank[u12MTmain[[All, ir]]], {ir, u12irr}];\nchecks[\"12.9b torus-completed HW rank (control omega = y)\"] = MatrixRank[u12MTctrl];\nchecks[\"12.9b torus-completed per-irrep ranks (control omega = y)\"] = Table[MatrixRank[u12MTctrl[[All, ir]]], {ir, u12irr}];\nchecks[\"12.9b the fixed-w1 relation: rank of {a', c', b', a'c'} as functions of y (3 = one relation)\"] = u12coefRank[{u12ap, u12cp, u12bp, u12ap u12cp}];\nGrid[{{\"torus = character (exact)\", checks[\"12.9b torus = character on the HW overlaps (exact residual)\"]}, {\"torus-completed HW rank, per irrep\", checks[\"12.9b torus-completed HW rank (omega = w2(y)), expect 6\"], checks[\"12.9b torus-completed per-irrep ranks\"]}, {\"control omega = y: torus-completed HW rank, per irrep\", checks[\"12.9b torus-completed HW rank (control omega = y)\"], checks[\"12.9b torus-completed per-irrep ranks (control omega = y)\"]}, {\"rank of {a', c', b', a'c'} as functions of y (4 would mean independent)\", checks[\"12.9b the fixed-w1 relation: rank of {a', c', b', a'c'} as functions of y (3 = one relation)\"]}}, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
